or": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069383 - Put the generated newtab Nova tokens in cascade layers and add the missing prefers-contrast overrides. r=reemhamz\n\nEvery declaration in the generated _tokens.scss is re-indented, so the only substantive change there is the new prefers-contrast block.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323733\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/styles/nova/_tokens.scss", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/nova-newtab-format/get-newtab-token-css.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/nova-newtab-format/get-newtab-tokens-by-layer.mjs"], "git_node": "c239782d2cba183f6939d578700a97474cf1f176", "git_parents": ["7a02bc8e39802af2ac98f860a94f776012d0a5c5"], "node": "a0073190ff82a56d3236d18d3fcd7a54e5f1f376", "parents": ["2331e8c65d5247326a648ddf25872664e2615e39"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069383 - Name the real pref in the generated newtab tokens header. r=reemhamz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323734\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/styles/nova/_tokens.scss", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/nova-newtab-format/newtab-file-header.mjs"], "git_node": "e3e964bc39396a82e2ddc4cd495c55498c033003", "git_parents": ["c239782d2cba183f6939d578700a97474cf1f176"], "node": "4b7346c10a4794adc88ed68f3b61fa3feaf63c3c", "parents": ["a0073190ff82a56d3236d18d3fcd7a54e5f1f376"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070779 - Allow --panel-separator-color as a border color in use-design-tokens. r=desktop-theme-reviewers,emilio\n\nThe token is a color, but the generated semantic categories file it under box-shadow, so no border category picks it up and every consumer draws its separator through a disable comment.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323736\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/customizableui/panelUI-shared.css", "toolkit/content/widgets/panel-list/panel-list.css", "toolkit/themes/shared/menu.css", "tools/lint/stylelint/stylelint-plugin-mozilla/config.mjs", "tools/lint/stylelint/stylelint-plugin-mozilla/tests/use-design-tokens.border-color.tests.mjs"], "git_node": "da4ee9d9e7896d6b7a18daf4e486c05bdcb0980a", "git_parents": ["e3e964bc39396a82e2ddc4cd495c55498c033003"], "node": "7bdd5e185390f641825eb8f7b525d42465f76b77", "parents": ["4b7346c10a4794adc88ed68f3b61fa3feaf63c3c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070550 - Part 1: Don't use toolbar color for sidebar expand-on-hover launcher. r=kcochrane,desktop-theme-reviewers\n\nWrong color to use nowadays for sure since we are under the toolbox.\nThis restores pre-nova behavior but doesn't fully fix the issue.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324662\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/sidebar.css"], "git_node": "a8122404ce74e395bf8adb19a8284288e19d387d", "git_parents": ["da4ee9d9e7896d6b7a18daf4e486c05bdcb0980a"], "node": "e1d588468a0598fa1cf2f005a2cdddb7093ebd31", "parents": ["7bdd5e185390f641825eb8f7b525d42465f76b77"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070550 - Part 2 - If we have a toolbox gradient, use it as part of the opaque backdrop. r=kcochrane,desktop-theme-reviewers\n\nThis improves the default themes, by using the toolbox background\ngradient on top, which makes it more seamless.\n\nNote that if we don't, the gradient is image(transparent), or solid\ncolors otherwise, so the size / declarations don't matter.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324664\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/sidebar.css"], "git_node": "24fc5cd2b7c80d9f74dc61