 - Add a `duplicate` transform to copy another kind's tasks with overrides r=ahal,taskgraph-reviewers\n\nManually duplicating every task definition produced by a kind lets the copy\ndrift as the source changes. Test variants already avoid this for a single\ntest task, but a difference compiled into artifacts needs a separate build of\nevery task it affects.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320191\n", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/attributes.md", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/python.toml", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/test_transforms_duplicate.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/duplicate.py"], "git_node": "8b585af0440a07985002678c01dbd8f88c4cfe19", "git_parents": ["1dcfd3709446f8d38014e835b4cea49926e042d5"], "node": "8b75e65c2fb2fef55189ad1399370e61da1bb721", "parents": ["47ee8a0dde34ca8afbb456dea9aba22dc8bc873f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Giulia Cardieri \u003cgcardieri@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067140: Move smart window box-shadow only to fullpage new tab r=mlucks,desktop-theme-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325076\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-window/ai-window.css", "browser/themes/addons/aiwindow-nova/aiwindow-theme-nova.css"], "git_node": "4b4724a38279499eac88a833d9cf5f7a0ac7aa30", "git_parents": ["8b585af0440a07985002678c01dbd8f88c4cfe19"], "node": "498dfea6caf33796eef9e693d50a4f50c0b1e4af", "parents": ["8b75e65c2fb2fef55189ad1399370e61da1bb721"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070840 - Dispatch TabMultiSelect on the tab strip instead of tabpanels. r=tabbrowser-reviewers,niklas\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324898\n", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/parent/ext-browser.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/Tabbrowser.sys.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/docs/tab-events.md"], "