or": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071134 - Use the default Debian 13 toolchain-build image for the remaining wasi and openh264 tasks. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden\n\ndeb13-toolchain-build is now the default image for toolchain tasks, so the explicit setting on the wasi\ncompiler-rt and sysroot tasks is redundant. openh264-plugin isn't a toolchain task and has no default,\nso move it from deb12 to deb13 explicitly.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325224\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/openh264-plugin/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/toolchain/compiler-rt.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/toolchain/sysroot.yml"], "git_node": "b2bfc797299929ea9190e9c02561887dc5ff47f0", "git_parents": ["d7cb04ea8f35d1de5416f362d04f1f1785507e99"], "node": "8d6e81804415b7209a2b2a2db5c7f259e23d2616", "parents": ["1cd83bfb014da4c470bf445902d1eb77285f2d97"], "tags": []}, {"author": "owlishDeveloper \u003cbugzeeeeee@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057685 - Part 3: Add IPC to get full scrollable size and device pixel ratio from content r=emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318615\n", "files": ["dom/base/Element.h", "dom/ipc/PWindowGlobal.ipdl", "dom/ipc/WindowGlobalChild.cpp", "dom/ipc/WindowGlobalChild.h"], "git_node": "3fa9e2861b471e0f65374d3930b904bee9d228ff", "git_parents": ["b2bfc797299929ea9190e9c02561887dc5ff47f0"], "node": "ba3e2d63e067ab5230db3e6b6c0dfe3e87725349", "parents": ["8d6e81804415b7209a2b2a2db5c7f259e23d2616"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e 48d93a2e79fe91518b850a6de8eedd03f26ebaf9\naf -\u003e 48d93a2e79fe91518b850a6de8eedd03f26ebaf9\nan -\u003e 48d93a2e79fe91518b850a6de8eedd03f26ebaf9\nar -\u003e 48d93a2e79fe9151