c update from web-platform-tests\nmake a few `touch-action` pointerevents tests work under 800x600\n\nSigned-off-by: Euclid Ye \u003cyezhizhenjiakang@gmail.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 243110c04f0911a6dbaaac6f537780bd522641f3\nwpt-pr: 62498\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/pointerevents/pointerevent_touch-action-inherit_child-auto-child-none_touch.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/pointerevents/pointerevent_touch-action-inherit_child-none_touch.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/pointerevents/pointerevent_touch-action-inherit_child-pan-x-child-pan-y_touch.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/pointerevents/pointerevent_touch-action-svg-none-test_touch.html"], "git_node": "a3f789a801ff88329704bc2dfd7984c2efdf782a", "git_parents": ["3e5adbc1e502d78184d96edf1d52a6e1cad939c0"], "node": "049a67d06a010aa05b29c9d29af8a4091ccb8134", "parents": ["cb3233f5d8cf007bc091d6bc9c32edc2783bc58b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tim van der Lippe \u003ctvanderlippe@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070318 [wpt PR 62432] - script: Fix crash when first child of head is selected for delete, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nscript: Fix crash when first child of head is selected for delete\n\nFixes a crash observed when combined with keybinding support. This\nis also tested in various ways in\n`delete-in-child-of-head.tentative.html`, but requires quite a bit\nof machinery. The new test is more straightforward and uses fewer\nfeatures, in line with WPT philosophy.\n\nPart of #25005\n\nTesting: new WPT crash test\n\nSigned-off-by: Tim van der Lippe \u003ctvanderlippe@gmail.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 54a8e7cf9336b35f3153e04c10aa5586db69e2ee\nwpt-pr: 62432\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/editing/crashtests/delete-at-start-of-head.html"], "git_node": "b5016bc532e93db05f74ba695625480cbbd7e7c2", "git_parents": ["a3f789a801ff88329704bc2dfd7984c2efdf782a"], "node": "ec9a0e8671dabb8a6d93282b63e600e5365a7c78", "parents": ["049a67d06a010aa05b29c9d29af8a4091ccb8134"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Josh Matthews \u003cjosh@joshmatthews.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070323 [wpt PR 62416] - script: Return actual placeholder container element if it exists., a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nscript: Return actual placeholder container element if it exists.\n\nSigned-off-by: Josh Matthews \u003cjosh@joshmatthews.net\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 4e8c9d131c21e82e33547583336bded759c4a5bd\nwpt-pr: 62416\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/forms/the-input-element/placeholder-update-no-value-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/forms/the-input-element/placeholder-update-no-value.html"], "git_node": "94eaaac7472f14e9b51adeb330ac25afbc8cea07", "git_parents": ["b5016bc532e93db05f74ba695625480cbbd7e7c2"], "node": "7c5fa6996431a8582ce2827388a205fff4b61963", "parents": ["ec9a0e8671dabb8a6d93282b63e600e5365a7c78"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070323 [wpt PR 62416] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62416\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/forms/the-input-element/input-form-detach-style-crash.html.ini"], "git_node": "0c90e2fe26e06c20e454b3a46841a2a6471afbf6", "git_parents": ["94eaaac7472f14e9b51adeb330ac25afbc8cea07"], "node": "54ee56c4a0b89a2220e405c24051be4f414945a8", "parents": ["7c5fa6996431a8582ce2827388a205fff4b61963"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mxmgorin \u003c102797145+mxmgorin@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070328 [wpt PR 62330] - layout: Advance the containing block walk past boxless ancestors, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nlayout: Advance the containing block walk past boxless ancestors\n\nSigned-off-by: mxmgorin \u003c102797145+mxmgorin@users.noreply.github.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 7c028795db256ec4450cbafeb5752e03749b41d1\nwpt-pr: 62330\n", "