"node": "3ef2202640bc42b60eaf95a66db3e2feee973e04", "parents": ["91ea849877cc909cd634efa36e3e901213750fd1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "unifolia \u003cjlewis@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064054 - Make the Organize Tabs flyout a dismissable popup so Wayland can place it beside the panel r=Mardak\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324447\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AutoTabGrouping.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_group_tabs_button_interaction.js"], "git_node": "0d23b5ed2702e93fe3e7dbe3edacfeffe062882f", "git_parents": ["18cdfeacc16e7249efda36488761d1c578a85a31"], "node": "1f94b2eb72edb862133b3244fdaf11ef944b842b", "parents": ["3ef2202640bc42b60eaf95a66db3e2feee973e04"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071253 - Fix verifyTabsTrayListViewTest UI test r=aaronmt\n\nThe UI test was sometimes failing because it failed to verify that the normal tabs list is displayed.\n\nTo fix this, I've changed for waiting for the empty tabs list to not exist to waiting for the normal tabs list to exists.\nI've also removed some redundant actions from the tests.\n\n\u2757  This change also fixes **verifyTabsTrayGridViewTest** UI test\n\nBoth tests successfully passed 50x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325356\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/TabbedBrowsingTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/robots/TabDrawerRobot.kt"], "git_node": "9fecf287d5b54b846c21a27fafab5395f1945411", "git_parents": ["0d23b5ed2702e93fe3e7dbe3edacfeffe062882f"], "node": "65c458cc9bab42780f7c9dcc8f5b831453554bb5", "parents": ["1f94b2eb72edb862133b3244fdaf11ef944b842b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sarah Clements \u003csclements@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070260 - Migrate old sidebar users to hide-launcher visibility and enable sidebar.revamp in all builds r=kcochrane,firefox-desktop-core-reviewers ,mossop,fluent-reviewers,settings-reviewers,sessionstore-reviewers,tgiles,sthompson,bolsson,jsudiaman\n\n* Add migration and enable sidebar.revamp in beta and release\n* Remove show sidebar checkbox from the tab browsing section in about:preferences\n* Fix sidebar bug where switcher label isn't showing if a tool isn't already saved in preferences\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324600\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/BrowserGlue.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ProfileDataUpgrader.sys.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/config/tabs-browsing.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/tests/browser_srd_telemetry_bucket_migration.js", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/unit/data/sessionstore_complete.json", "browser/components/sidebar/SidebarManager.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sidebar/browser-sidebar.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_hide_sidebar.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/marionette/test_default_launcher_visible.py", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/preferences/preferences.ftl"], "git_node": "5b5214a6a77b899778b02d58b1ea8188ac00b6d1", "git_parents": ["9fecf287d5b54b846c21a27fafab5395f1945411"], "node": "412eacd5769ede22a49f46e0741d13f52fc68b8d", "parents": ["65c458cc9bab42780f7c9dcc8f5b831453554bb5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071212 - Initialize SECItem::type before PK11_ImportSymKey in NSSCipherStrategy::Init (Coverity CID 1700949) r=dom-storage-reviewers,jari\n\nkeyItem was default-constructed and only had data and len assigned, leaving\ntype indeterminate when it was handed to PK11_ImportSymKey. Use aggregate\ninitialization with siBuffer, matching the `SECItem empty = {siBuffer, nullptr,\n0}` on the following line.\n\nDifferential Revi