heme-reviewers,nsharpley,emilio\" for causing bc failures @ browser_syncedtabs_firefoxview.js\n\nThis reverts commit d89caae212e8f862dad014f2d0d9d6c416f1aa0d.\n", "files": ["browser/components/firefoxview/SyncedTabsController.sys.mjs", "browser/components/firefoxview/firefox-view-synced-tabs-error-handler.sys.mjs", "browser/components/firefoxview/tests/browser/browser_syncedtabs_errors_firefoxview.js", "browser/themes/shared/sidebar/kit-page-history.svg", "browser/themes/shared/sidebar/kit-qr-tabs-devices-empty.svg", "browser/themes/shared/sidebar/kit-tabs-devices-error.svg", "browser/themes/shared/sidebar/kit-tabs-devices.svg"], "git_node": "14074048e1b32fb6c8fbcb73043a497d56481849", "git_parents": ["a549011bd2d69dfaef7341cdf0975850a8433860"], "node": "0020ffc7480050c40bf2ddc3ba51368d60d1f296", "parents": ["a7d0f4b8f36f0c97f1e80dcfac9a2ab96eafef14"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2067259 - Update mochitest expectations for revised font-family quoting behavior. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\" for causing multiple mochitest/wpt failures\n\nThis reverts commit df98b6d9d51f31da65c27639fcf3567a50160c89.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2067259 - Update WPT metadata to reflect revised behavior. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\"\n\nThis reverts commit 2d8ea0cf9bf0a949ee641fd71a37dadf1edf409f.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2067259 - When FamilyName is used for font names in src:local(), force its syntax to be Quoted. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\"\n\nThis reverts commit 9b5381db886516a1a0b676b6576dcf929a32742a.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2067259 - Rework the criteria used to determine whether font-family names are quoted. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\"\n\nThis reverts commit 11750f08e266e97699c656ba876d6b9555a98689.\n", "files": ["layout/style/test/test_font_face_parser.html", "layout/style/test/test_font_family_serialization.html", "servo/components/style/font_face.rs", "servo/components/style/values/computed/font.rs", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-font-loading/fontface-css-connected-descriptors.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-fonts/parsing/font-family-computed.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-fonts/parsing/font-family-valid.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-fonts/variations/font-weight-matching-installed-fonts.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/cssom/font-family-serialization-001.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/cssom/serialize-values.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-fonts/font-family-src-quoted.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-fonts/parsing/font-family-invalid.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/cssom/font-family-serialization-001.html"], "git_node": "4705d3f66cbcfcb5b2395d39a3c63ba831433eab", "git_parents": ["14074048e1b32fb6c8fbcb73043a497d56481849"], "node": "0df482861a4283a33485e80e5876993e22ae640c", "parents": ["0020ffc7480050c40bf2ddc3ba51368d60d1f296"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071214 - Null-check the menupopup frame in XULButtonAccessible::AreItemsOperable (Coverity CID 1286730) r=accessibility-platform-reviewers,morgan\n\ndo_QueryFrame returns nullptr when the frame is not an nsMenuPopupFrame, but\nthe result was dereferenced unconditionally. The first child of a menu button\nis not guaranteed to be a menupopup, so a11y state queries on such a button\ncould dereference null.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325329\n", "files": ["accessible/xul/XULFormControlAccessible.cpp"], "git_node": "9d6b66e4adcea107bb5465f077492e926b3f901f", "git_parents": ["4705d3f66cbcfcb5b2395d39a3c63ba831433eab"], "node": "803ac73a5e3ab62b354b21cc2f0eb20509d794aa", "parents": ["0df482861a4283a33485e80e5876993e22ae640c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jeff Muizelaar \u003cjmuizelaar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068188 - Use a string-literal wrapper type for simple payload marker field names. r=bas,profiler-reviewers,canova\n\nThis avoids the need to create the `defined_name_##arg` constants which will\nlet us add support for named arguments using string literals. It's also\nsimpler.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322682\n", "files": ["tools/profiler/public/ProfilerMarkers.h"], "git_node": "d38eccd9a9ae399526274284ce5cea7f162ded15", "git_parents": ["9d6b66e4adcea107bb5465f077492e926b3f901f"], "node": "79e7e30858d4f2b38ec39f7127652a874149c9e9", "parents": ["803ac73a5e3ab62b354b21cc2f0eb20509d794aa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Moss \u003cjmoss@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070972 - Repeat the loopback video test frame with imagefreeze r=aryx\n\nUse the current v4l2loopback control IDs. Repeat one green frame with GStreamer imagefreeze so the producer continues to supply frames while tests open and close the video device. The existing cleanup stops the producer.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325488\n", "files": ["testing/mochitest/runtests.py"], "git_node": "d4d2059b980c0eade40bd16cee39d587b453f20d", "git_parents": ["d38eccd9a9ae399526274284ce5cea7f162ded15"], "node": "2d26271ea39b521f629e212c0778beb79d553e69", "parents": ["79e7e30858d4f2b38ec39f7127652a874149c9e9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1594264 - Enable sql normalization r=mak\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321974\n", "files": ["storage/moz.build", "third_party/sqlite3/src/moz.build", "third_party/sqlite3/src/sqlite.symbols"], "git_node": "c90dbfd108f5baa2361bacf6662aaced631ef3b1", "git_parents": ["d4d2059b980c0eade40bd16cee39d587b453f20d"], "node": "f8c68e5b81c0c7e9493a7e01b60e592e084e254d", "parents": ["2d26271ea39b521f629e212c0778beb79d553e69"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1977639 - Report slow SQL over Glean r=mak\n\nsqlite3_normalized_sql is only available for prepared statements, so\nthis specifically does not report on simple sql executions.\n\nThis does not remove the existing Legacy Telemetry reporting (yet).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321975\n", "files": ["storage/metrics.yaml", "storage/mozStorageConnection.cpp", "storage/mozStorageConnection.h", "storage/mozStorageService.cpp", "storage/pings.yaml", "toolkit/components/glean/metrics_index.py"], "git_node": "34cb382e4c9dd17e778514050b266cbbac17480b", "git_parents": ["c90dbfd108f5baa2361bacf6662aaced631ef3b1"], "node": "e242d4dca91544c08274f97084bdaef2b459b50e", "parents": ["f8c68e5b81c0c7e9493a7e01b60e592e084e254d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Harshit \u003chsohaney@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067218 - Accept a --profile argument in the notification helper. r=aborondo,nrishel\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322372\n", "files": ["Cargo.lock", "build/workspace-hack/Cargo.toml", "toolkit/library/rust/moz.build", "toolkit/mozapps/pushnotificationhelper/Cargo.toml", "toolkit/mozapps/pushnotificationhelper/src/main.rs"], "git_node": "9847f371083119e1ef5204edaf3e948b0cea518a", "git_parents": ["34cb382e4c9dd17e778514050b266cbbac17480b"], "node": "b688a0e5ec9df7589a51f7ccdcfeecd652a24df2", "parents": ["e242d4dca91544c08274f97084bdaef2b459b50e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Harshit \u003chsohaney@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067218 - Add a Nimbus-controlled pref gating the notification helper. r=iholmes\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322520\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/BrowserComponents.manifest", "toolkit/components/nimbus/FeatureManifest.yaml", "toolkit/mozapps/pushnotificationhelper/PushNotificationHelper.sys.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/pushnotificationhelper/WindowsPushNo