"git_parents": ["8b002b080b54f1cda1cbb14f4efa782d31900a42"], "node": "84e63a342ca3536316329ca4847970e525bb5906", "parents": ["08f1b85fdc41556f271835abeefe974e85150945"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069067 - Vendor libwebrtc from a6a69f69ad\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/a6a69f69aded058870d829562d563be8c6ab4f3f\n    Validate RtpHeaderExtensionId range during construction\n\n    Add RtpHeaderExtensionId::Create to do similar validation at run-time.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:514817938\n    Change-Id: Ibc69afff67e90b0675e101236d624fad9bece9b2\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/495420\n    Reviewed-by: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48414}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_header_extension_id.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_header_extension_id_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/webrtc_sdp.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_header_extension_map_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "e43c2ef4096b0ecd811978f8181c97e4f901a173", "git_parents": ["941bed1a667f696d999aa5d36af5d1e94018dcb9"], "node": "7c2471c73d36e77fe17f0ed6896ba2f61e895126", "parents": ["84e63a342ca3536316329ca4847970e525bb5906"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069067 - Vendor libwebrtc from 9be6d6a88e\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/9be6d6a88e8ae4bc91dd101dc4e1d473ae396dc1\n    Improve documentation for the new video encoder API.\n\n    This CL adds mostly automated formatting and style fixes. One functional\n    change is this added paragraph under the section for `num_buffers` of\n    the prediction constraints:\n    ```\n      If the encoder implementation\n      supports reference frame control, it must indicate at least a value of 1.\n      Implementations that don't support reference frame control must indicate a\n      value of 0.\n    ```\n\n    Bug: webrtc:496266459\n    Change-Id: Ib9dd658ec4635e4da1e081e84b56260be7cb7ab5\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/497302\n    Reviewed-by: Sergey Silkin \u003cssilkin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48415}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/video_codecs/g3doc/video_encoder_api_v2.md"], "git_node": "925be66fce161dce85383744b8f91076bc4684ee", "git_parents": ["e43c2ef4096b0ecd811978f8181c97e4f901a173"], "node": "6bcdf2df5eec07387d923e8ac8095d4746c540fe", "parents": ["7c2471c73d36e77fe17f0ed6896ba2f61e895126"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dan Baker \u003cdbaker@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069067 - Vendor libwebrtc from 567348ea6e\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/567348ea6eb2b6ac2684c666f1580dcfb8e94322\n    Remove obsolete vp8cx_remove_encoder_threads TSan suppression\n\n    libvpx has added synchronization primitives since this suppression was\n    added.\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: Ia36b7d16095619ed4809dc898310e8c9e08eb693\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/496980\n    Commit-Queue: Fredrik Solenberg \u003csolenberg@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48416}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/tools_webrtc/sanitizers/tsan_suppressions_webrtc.cc"], "git_node": "f71b8a559da4e6ff9b0a41181416066ec67b3818", "git_parents": ["925be66fce161dce85383744b8f91076bc4684ee"], "node": "95119b28134bf9eb29404d6d7ccb2baf7472030a", "parents": ["6bcdf2df