hash to generic-worker checkout caches too r=taskgraph-reviewers,bhearsum,ahal\" as requested by @ahochheiden.\n\nThis reverts commit 51050cbd336bb28a21948072c4c1d448e3ff257e.\n\nThis reverts commit 8928e668fbcb08069826dad3a4a3893a917af6f5.\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/task.py"], "git_node": "085d5325fc826a95f322a1d739402c398bb7eeb6", "git_parents": ["f536f1c65057e931addc255854178ab55b492404"], "node": "303b043c818c6f781b7aa52b22a133f78da73d85", "parents": ["b7b73102e8fb0c9c38b85d37821f89ea26de5a8d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Serban Stanca \u003csstanca@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2071232, Bug 2070914, Bug 2070909 - Give the editor's column breakpoint markers an accessible name, r=devtools-reviewers,bomsy.\" for causing Linux mochitests failures.\n\nThis reverts commit 6acfcf358b3e2f9bd70787f8e25db1102e875708.\n\nThis reverts commit 9fbac5a6e20eaa70f0c258f649853b8898650d0b.\n\nThis reverts commit c1895a114ea561958815f0cf5b0c560789c9d43d.\n", "files": ["devtools/client/debugger/src/components/Editor/ColumnBreakpoints.js", "devtools/client/debugger/src/components/PrimaryPanes/ProjectSearch.js", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_af.toml", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_gp.toml", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/browser_qz.toml", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/integration/browser.toml", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/sourcemaps/browser.toml", "devtools/client/debugger/test/mochitest/tracer/browser.toml", "devtools/client/framework/test/browser.toml", "devtools/client/inspector/extensions/test/browser.toml", "devtools/client/locales/en-US/debugger.properties", "devtools/client/memory/test/browser/browser.toml", "devtools/client/netmonitor/test/browser_mz.toml", "devtools/client/shared/components/Tree.js", "devtools/client/shared/components/VirtualizedTree.js", "devtools/client/shared/components/test/node/components/tree.test.js", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_jsterm.toml", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_webconsole_ak.toml", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_webconsole_lz.toml", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_webconsole_object_inspector.toml", "testing/mochitest/tests/SimpleTest/AccessibilityUtils.js"], "git_node": "ad03a1b3d9f5528f9c7a131813c7e1e386a42ed3", "git_parents": ["085d5325fc826a95f322a1d739402c398bb7eeb6"], "node": "4d9c6002a13f905ce678144b3745c9b712ab12ce", "parents": ["303b043c818c6f781b7aa52b22a133f78da73d85"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Guichard \u003cnicolas.guichard@kdab.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070387 - Skip tests skipped on android-em-14-x86_64/opt on android-em-14-x86_64-ccov/opt as well. r=intermittent-reviewers,ahal\n\nandroid-em-14-x86_64-ccov/opt is almost identical to the bare opt\nvariant, but with added instrumentation for code coverage, so any test\nskipped on the opt variant should be skipped on the ccov variant as\nwell, for the same reason.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325629\n", "files": ["docshell/test/navigation/mochitest.toml", "dom/events/test/mochitest.toml", "dom/webtransport/test/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml", "dom/worklet/tests/mochitest.toml", "widget/tests/mochitest.toml"], "git_node": "2e70387e03ff1bfe3bcba31545919e219c7d656e", "git_parents": ["ad03a1b3d9f5528f9c7a131813c7e1e386a42ed3"], "node": "89ebe8a671d76aa3e5144a3316e617388fc9354c", "parents": ["4d9c6002a13f905ce678144b3745c9b712ab12ce"], "tags": []}, {"author": "David Shin \u003cdshin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061293: Block script execution during deferred animation timeline update. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\n\n... Also, null guard against effects that no longer have a target.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325516\n", "files": ["layout/style/nsAnimationManager.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/web-animations/crashtests/firefox-bug-2061293-1-crash.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/web-animations/crashtests/firefox-bug-2061293-2-crash.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/web-animations/crashtests/firefox-bug-2061293-3-crash.html"], "git_node": "d0e8fc34175264937522087853e5796a152469a6", "git_parents": ["2e70387e03ff1bfe3bcba31545919e219c7d656e"], "node": "f51204676bbb9b0121e660625c0044e6727f5fa1", "parents": ["89ebe8a671d76aa3e5144a3316e617388fc9354c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1928041: Run the macOS 15 \"Fill\" action on a titlebar double click. r=mac-reviewers,mstange\n\nmacOS 15 added \"Fill\" as a third choice for \"Double-click a window's title bar to\", next to \"Zoom\" and \"Minimize\". We hide the native titlebar and run the action ourselves when a double click lands in one of our draggable regions, and we only knew about the other two, so nothing happened.\n\nBased on the patch that darlaes attached in attachment 9613843.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322617\n", "files": ["widget/cocoa/nsCocoaUtils.h", "widget/cocoa/nsCocoaUtils.mm", "widget/cocoa/nsCocoaWindow.mm"], "git_node": "808516c30b36f49cd332ac73ddc782e8769ef4fa", "git_parents": ["d0e8fc34175264937522087853e5796a152469a6"], "node": "adfd4627874c2fb4163bb9035532abc813c90720", "parents": ["f51204676bbb9b0121e660625c0044e6727f5fa1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kui-Feng Lee \u003cthinker.li@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069399 - Hold references to the print dialog's header/footer dropdowns. r=stransky,gtk-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324694\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsPrintDialogGTK.cpp"], "git_node": "ac352a8c1c3b11f205c746e42935b942b8ad793c", "git_parents": ["808516c30b36f49cd332ac73ddc782e8769ef4fa"], "node": "73ed1afde58f27640fa5b6655539ffd867b82234", "parents": ["adfd4627874c2fb4163bb9035532abc813c90720"], "tags": []}, {"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072264 - Move tspan/textPath bbox calculation to SVGUtils::GetBBox r=emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326217\n", "files": ["dom/svg/SVGGraphicsElement.cpp", "layout/svg/ISVGDisplayableFrame.h", "layout/svg/SVGUtils.cpp"], "git_node": "567848c12012b8916c95c17531e4fce4972c5ae7", "git_parents": ["ac352a8c1c3b11f205c746e42935b942b8ad793c"], "node": "d630ad143e6dbeb9ca2dfda338531f38fc2ed069", "parents": ["73ed1afde58f27640fa5b6655539ffd867b82234"], "tags": []}, {"author": "sarah541 \u003csarahkhan1107@hotmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058533 - Add a PromoCard highlighting the Collections to Tab Groups migration in the Tab Groups page r=android-reviewers,gl\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323690\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabgroups/TabGroupsPageTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/collections/CollectionsMigrationPromoCard.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/TabsTrayTestTag.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/redux/action/TabGroupAction.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/redux/middleware/CollectionsMigrationMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/redux/reducer/TabGroupActionReducer.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/redux/state/TabsTrayState.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/ui/TabManagementFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/ui/tabpage/TabGroupList.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/ui/tabpage/TabGroupsPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/ui/tabstray/TabsTray.kt", "mobile/androi