omium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071642 [wpt PR 62659] - Remove text-decoration on links in color-svg-visited.html test, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nRemove text-decoration on links in color-svg-visited.html test\n\nThis is causing inconsistencies on Edge for reasons unrelated to the\npurpose of the test.\nhttps://wpt.fyi/analyzer?screenshot=sha1%3A2cb20898fba6fbadbd7ebad7b9376a3b60967458&screenshot=sha1%3A1bebbf0c17b99eb569ef73282115642198642792\n\nFixed: 517708426\nChange-Id: I8b7ff0e9eec180c1643fbbc4d8086efea65f9524\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8393746\nReviewed-by: Mike Taylor \u003cmiketaylr@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Mike Taylor \u003cmiketaylr@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Ari Chivukula \u003carichiv@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1696885}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: b41e047b23c38f447eca669275046ab8c103935e\nwpt-pr: 62659\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-color/color-svg-visited.html"], "git_node": "086bda6423088efe6290e7f14c59bd5fd3a27dab", "git_parents": ["8b50a64c57920e7f10095fddb3c21ea0f607fda5"], "node": "a129aaa576199e677a92d199f142ef13991008e5", "parents": ["f4f4b8485e76da433de11340dac215fc1ed528f0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ahmad Saleem \u003c52317531+Ahmad-S792@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071495 [wpt PR 62630] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=323928, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=323928 (#62630)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: a1e59538d34f1721ffa52e2a8c78a308012800c8\nwpt-pr: 62630\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/datastore/datatransferitemlist-clear-read-only.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/editing/dnd/datastore/datatransferitemlist-clear.html"], "git_node": "8d3e6a7e157d7c6aba30c1ca84930926ba281dc6", "git_parents": ["086bda6423088efe6290e7f14c59