"branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070671: Clear autocomplete fill when we change rows with different providers r=omarg,credential-management-reviewers,mtigley,dimi\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326276\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_smartwindow_smartformfill_autocomplete.js", "toolkit/actors/AutoCompleteParent.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "bc5390debec454d9f6e86d23d723e88d76181b2e", "git_parents": ["e55501e15e5cf07fa305c8eea44be47d4f689f41"], "node": "0643ba10fac5d2c306c68e3cb2dfa039e58ed000", "parents": ["5871819f7138c634acdea029dbc364db423600e9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Greg Stoll \u003cgreg@gregstoll.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067101 - check allocation for out of memory condition r=beth\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324666\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/Preferences.cpp"], "git_node": "55000b15592c1aa56e7902de3f8f75c365a38d0c", "git_parents": ["bc5390debec454d9f6e86d23d723e88d76181b2e"], "node": "db6b75f3e3956683182829eb57eb1eaa89abbccf", "parents": ["0643ba10fac5d2c306c68e3cb2dfa039e58ed000"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2062317 - Fix tests that synthesize input before the window is positioned, r=farre\" for causing build bustages\n\nThis reverts commit e55501e15e5cf07fa305c8eea44be47d4f689f41.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2062317, be more synchronous with DOMContentLoaded, r=farre,extension-reviewers,robwu\"\n\nThis reverts commit f19022c5ec9a9ca51bfe1415cdb73c8247e02510.\n", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/base/Document.h", "dom/base/test/file_domcontentloaded_document_open.html", "dom/base/test/file_domcontentloaded_terminated_parse.html", "dom/base/test/mochitest.toml", "dom/base/test/test_domcontentloaded_document_open.html", "dom/base/test/test_domcontentloaded_terminated_parse.html", "dom/base/test/unit/test_blockParsing.js", "dom/prototype/PrototypeDocumentContentSink.cpp", "dom/script/ScriptLoader.cpp", "dom/script/ScriptLoader.h", "dom/xml/XMLDocument.cpp", "dom/xml/XMLDocument.h", "dom/xml/nsXMLContentSink.cpp", "layout/base/tests/accessiblecaret_magnifier.html", "layout/base/tests/bug1448730.html", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "parser/html/nsHtml5TreeOpExecutor.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/browsers/the-window-object/named-access-on-the-window-object/navigated-named-objects.window.js.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/syntax/parsing/DOMContentLoaded-defer-task-order.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/syntax/parsing/DOMContentLoaded-defer.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/syntax/parsing/DOMContentLoaded-defer-task-order.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/linking/scripted/a.rel-noreferrer-policy.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/linking/scripted/resources/a.rel-noreferrer-policy-frame.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/linking/scripted/resources/a.rel-noreferrer-policy-target.html", "toolkit/components/extensions/test/xpcshell/test_ext_contentscript_order.js", "toolkit/content/tests/browser/browser_about_restricted.js", "widget/tests/test_dnd_ignoreNuls.html"], "git_node": "034f39744d1e69e6ec53e1c3fd4933d42b341520", "git_parents": ["55000b15592c1aa56e7902de3f8f75c365a38d0c"], "node": "2626438fb4db38b73fe63210fe07aee5624fff8c", "parents": ["db6b75f3e3956683182829eb57eb1eaa89abbccf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2068982 - P3. Test the credit card migration r=joschmidt,credential-management-reviewers\" for causing bc failures at loginListChanges.js\n\nThis reverts commit a3f12212eac0b6bece10958b5f362690a3fd40e2.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2068982 - P2. Support migrating credit cards to the Rust store and serving them from it r=joschmidt,credential-management-reviewers\"\n\nThis reverts commit ce266bf6f202c58cf0d1746fd227fd0037ba3c0f.\n\nR