a-central repo-update remote-settings mobile-merino-manifest ct-logs - r=release-managers,diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327137\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-manifest/src/main/assets/manifest/manifest.json", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/ai-window-prompts.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/newtab-wallpapers-v2.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": "876d28086223cf79fbd02122c28dc1f560be7a57", "git_parents": ["2d4e29f32b6da7381c8b7e7261785d7985b2891d"], "node": "2b5d206209aec3597a1c9e206fba9f301657d209", "parents": ["8650df6e31a06f2711f409941af064852191d3e3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073227 - don't emit unsupported test tasks on artifact try pushes. r=taskgraph-reviewers,bhearsum\n\nCompiled tests can't run on top of artifact builds, so filter them out\nin the test transforms instead of waiting until target task selection.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327265\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/filter_tasks.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/target_tasks.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/test_target_tasks.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/test_transforms_test.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/test/__init__.py"], "git_node": "ee94cbfedd52ca9c4a6dceec88281783aa688c69", "git_parents": ["876d28086223cf79fbd02122c28dc1f560be7a57"], "node": "57b186cca78aaa7bf7708b76a8b0b8a126e00df7", "parents": ["2b5d206209aec3597a1c9e206fba9f301657d209"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephanie Cunnane \u003cscunnane@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072847 - Extend probe expiration date to 172: urlbar.searchmode.url_like_query. r=daleharvey\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327195\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/metrics.yaml"], "git_node": "9a23d5fc7037dff0fd42f500d560af625d9c65c1", "git_parents": ["ee94cbfedd52ca9c4a6dceec88281783aa688c69"], "node": "262d141d5353798dc39f2f60a14ed1d0f92266b3", "parents": ["57b186cca78aaa7bf7708b76a8b0b8a126e00df7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073150 - Deal with CSSOM enablement properly for chromeonly properties that are behind a pref. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,dshin\n\nThe front-end code is setting linkParameters with CSSOM, but right now\nGenerateCSSProperties doesn't deal correctly with a property enabled in\nChrome but behind a pref, it will either generate [Pref] or\n[ChromeOnly].\n\nThis allows to remove the special-case we had for backdrop-filter for\nthis case.\n\nInstead, make it share the enablement logic with nsCSSProps, which fixes\nthe theme picker when link-parameters is disabled by pref, and improve a\nbit the naming around this code.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327150\n", "files": ["layout/style/CSSPropFlags.h", "layout/style/GenerateCSSProperties.py", "layout/style/nsCSSProps.cpp", "layout/style/nsCSSProps.h", "layout/style/test/test_non_content_accessible_properties.html"], "git_node": "ed5c65cdc13b162181c2ff33918078e81ac5fbb1", "git_parents": ["9a23d5fc7037dff0fd42f500d560af625d9c65c1"], "node": "baeab8cc37fa758c1296ff600e315b6c9a65febb", "parents": ["262d141d5353798dc39f2f60a14ed1d0f92266b3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "R\u00e9mi Papilli\u00e9 \u003crpapillie@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073496 - Fix typo in WPT metadata. r=nical\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327378\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-backgrounds/__dir__.ini"], "git_node": "99cc485e8954e5875a3b8ec7214bce35976ae08b", "git_parents": ["ed5c65cdc13b162181c2ff33918078e81ac5fbb1"], "node": "1c161cd7f0e6d2d36c9c3ff4eb8ecccd56f25951", "parents": ["baeab8cc37fa758c1296ff600e315b6c9a65febb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Erich Gubler \u003cerichdongubler@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2006720 - fix(webgpu): recognize `maxStorage{Buffers,Textures}In{Vertex,Fragment}Stage` r=webgpu-reviewers,nical\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D276887\n", "files": ["dom/webgpu/SupportedLimits.cpp", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/meta/webgpu/cts/webgpu/api/operation/adapter/requestDevice/cts.https.html.ini"], "git_node": "d739d913b2db2ef1c184d26c8bae138edee176ca", "git_parents": ["99cc485e8954e5875a3b8ec7214bce35976ae08b"], "node": "7615456e6ce8ea7dad0e1c7bc7cb322d597120bc", "parents": ["1c161cd7f0e6d2d36c9c3ff4eb8ecccd56f25951"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Molly Shillabeer \u003cmshillabeer@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072622 - Ensure URL tokens in SFF value generation are resolved into URLs r=gcardieri,omarg,vazish\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326593\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/ChatUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/SmartFormFillModel.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_aitab_generation.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_smart_form_fill_model.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/test_ChatUtils.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/ChatConversation.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/UrlTokenizer.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_UrlTokenizer.js"], "git_node": "24466086866a46448c54f5d7db19d51a110ccb58", "git_parents": ["d739d913b2db2ef1c184d26c8bae138edee176ca"], "node": "1c40774faa7a12c73aee7fc6b9bd4423e23a80e4", "parents": ["7615456e6ce8ea7dad0e1c7bc7cb322d597120bc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gregory Mierzwinski \u003cgmierz1@live.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071339 - Add a detectionTechniques field to perfherder data schema. r=perftest-reviewers,afinder DONTBUILD\n\nAdd a new field in the perfherder data schema to let us specify what detection technique(s) to use on the subtest or suite.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325430\n", "files": ["testing/mozharness/external_tools/performance-artifact-schema.json"], "git_node": "4f4930e3ca5a34e5f38fb75a7bff0266517c18f7", "git_parents": ["24466086866a46448c54f5d7db19d51a110ccb58"], "node": "b2a2ae589a4816ddbe158b51d297cd351bd838c0", "parents": ["1c40774faa7a12c73aee7fc6b9bd4423e23a80e4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073117 - Remove dom.pointer-lock.unadjusted-movement.enabled; r=webidl,tschuster\n\nThe pref has been enabled by default since Firefox 152 (bug 2037802).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327362\n", "files": ["dom/webidl/Element.webidl", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "testing/web-platform/meta/pointerlock/__dir__.ini"], "git_node": "1813a7788d18b6835cd40034ceb4e7ef79277f6b", "git_parents": ["4f4930e3ca5a34e5f38fb75a7bff0266517c18f7"], "node": "07da7621a376ebc9af96faeee4df10ad05e0cdee", "parents": ["b2a2ae589a4816ddbe158b51d297cd351bd838c0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mimi \u003cmjung@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068837 - Expose a default attempt state to the menu message set to default prompt r=omc-reviewers,yazan\n\nExposes a default attempt targeting to the menu message set to default message for the current session. This avoids needing to used the uncached set to default targeting which was not performant while also avoiding showing the set to default card if a user sets Firefox to default within the browser (which is cached for 6hrs~).\n\nExpiring the cache results in needing another polling method and this self corrects on browser restart.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326737\n", "files": ["browser/components/asrouter/docs/targeting-attributes.md", "browser/components/asrouter/modules/ASRouterTargeting.sys.mjs", "browser/components/asrouter/modules/OnboardingMessageProvider.sys.mjs", "browser/components/asrouter/tests/browser/browser_asrouter_targeting.js", "browser/components/shell/ShellService.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "0c45fdf6cf288d0bdf21a9dfa13bb51d1806614e", "git_parents": ["1813a7788d18b6835cd40034ceb4e7ef79277f6b"], "node": "8c3fd2b8c431c50865c21be522f113cf0e043af4", "parents": ["07da7621a376ebc9af96faeee4df10ad05e0cdee"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059211: Introduce internal getter for blob sizes. r=dom-storage-reviewers,hsingh\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325120\n", "files": ["dom/file/BaseBlobImpl.h", "dom/file/BlobImpl.cpp", "dom/file/BlobImpl.h", "dom/file/FileBlobImpl.cpp", "dom/file/FileBlobImpl.h", "dom/file/MultipartBlobImpl.h", "dom/indexedDB/ActorsParent.cpp"], "git_node": "ad10ba22dfffc81e83e071d99eac62b42de5a62e", "git_parents": ["0c45fdf6cf288d0bdf21a9dfa13bb51d1806614e"], "node": "bc01fa171596e46f64bab7eda0131692fb2a2802", "parents": ["8c3fd2b8c431c50865c21be522f113cf0e043af4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mimi \u003cmjung@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063606 - Don't stretch ASRouterNewTabMessage content when the image is taller than the copy r=omc-reviewers,yazan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326688\n", "files": ["browser/components/asrouter/content/components/asrouter-newtab-message/asrouter-newtab-message.css", "browser/components/asrouter/content/components/asrouter-newtab-message/asrouter-newtab-message.stories.mjs"], "git_node": "610e2d113333f19b9dc22e68380c190607ef21ec", "git_parents": ["ad10ba22dfffc81e83e071d99eac62b42de5a62e"], "node": "b1850f2a098b757b2a6f7546897ccb0830fa32ef", "parents": ["bc01fa171596e46f64bab7eda0131692fb2a2802"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Markus Stange \u003cmstange.moz@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073279 - Fetch the crashreporter symbols for Talos and Raptor profiling tasks. r=taskgraph-reviewers,perftest-reviewers,releng-reviewers,bhearsum,sparky\n\nBug 1998767 changed symbolication to only look for\n$MOZ_FETCHES_DIR/target.crashreporter-symbols.zip; the existing --symbolsPath\nwas ignored. But Talos and Raptor tasks don't have target.crashreporter-symbols.zip\nin their $MOZ_FETCHES_DIR because they were using \"ondemand\" symbol fetching.\nIn bug 1998767 we were assuming that this ondemand symbolPaths was only needed for\nfallback symbolication and not for samply symbolication, but it turns out we were\npassing the path to samply, too, and now that's not happening anymore.\n\nThis patch adds the necessary fetches in add_gecko_profile_symbolication_deps,\nso that checking $MOZ_FETCHES_DIR/target.crashreporter-symbols.zip will now work.\nThis is simpler than fetching the zip from the symbolPaths; this transform already\ntouches exactly the cases where we know we'll be profiling.\n\nThe GeckoProfile action on Treeherder patches MOZ_FETCHES directly instead of\nrunning the transforms again, so add the zip there too.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327221\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/actions/gecko_profile.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/test/other.py"], "git_node": "3b5f653a49530488b99652d4b2d7ad4279621bfc", "git_parents": ["610e2d113333f19b9dc22e68380c190607ef21ec"], "node": "d1eb9d46aa8a7f657831b1b03fd4c29b4e5ee437", "parents": ["b1850f2a098b757b2a6f7546897ccb0830fa32ef"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ayoub hedri \u003cahedri@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069931 - Add Permissions Policy WebIDL bindings and enable related WPTs r=webidl,simonf,smaug\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D32736