1c3d0\nzh-TW -\u003e 6128ee685ad3a76de97d51313ef2715f9be1c3d0\n", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": "b060aa3907e9798fb8cff6c5f9db839214446de2", "git_parents": ["1db1a47d53bed59cd3d4e594837c6e7d4419f4ba"], "node": "0c34afb5c1b1f5fe4d98fb186a804fb1c1beafd8", "parents": ["bcaa3960a03320470b68df6dd25d46922a9af02e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073780 - Update PDF.js to 356109b29522416b49bb5f9e06a66588163631ef r=pdfjs-reviewers,marco\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327586\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/PdfJsVersion.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.scripting.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.worker.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer-geckoview.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer.css", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer.html", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/wasm/jbig2.wasm", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/wasm/jbig2_nowasm_fallback.js", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "6382d29872715990e51da4d8d961cd6e15aba195", "git_parents": ["b060aa3907e9798fb8cff6c5f9db839214446de2"], "node": "ed3d03c776ecf25c2cd64e6526c7bcccbc8b1390", "parents": ["0c34afb5c1b1f5fe4d98fb186a804fb1c1beafd8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Calixte Denizet \u003ccalixte.denizet@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072145 - Update PDF notification tests for lazy widget loading. r=pdfjs-reviewers,marco\n\nEmbedded viewers and impression-claim losers no longer load\nmoz-message-bar. Eligible top-level viewers load it after a page renders.\n\nWait for a page render before checking embedded viewers. Identify the claim\nwinner before selecting its tab and waiting for its bar. Wait for Fluent and\nResizeObserver updates before inspecting the CTA and layout.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327438\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/test/browser_pdfjs_features_notification.js", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/test/browser_pdfjs_features_notification_sync.js"], "git_node": "7983a035e2e0a47c173c37af08dce39854008e0a", "git_parents": ["6382d29872715990e51da4d8d961cd6e15aba195"], "node": "7356224f4b2834aaa456832d47c40d5f25c25d97", "parents": ["ed3d03c776ecf25c2cd64e6526c7bcccbc8b1390"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jeff Muizelaar \u003cjmuizelaar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073623 - Fill in JSFunction slot names. r=jonco\n\nIn my recent heap dump JSFunction was the most common type\nwith UNKNOWN SLOTS. This makes heap dumps a little nicer to read.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327463\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/JSObject.cpp"], "git_node": "1c96511df8ae667482f0c295c092ac34d3746189", "git_parents": ["7983a035e2e0a47c173c37af08dce39854008e0a"], "node": "c402e35d16885bdee64fb9bdc5e0d896225ec62e", "parents": ["7356224f4b2834aaa456832d47c40d5f25c25d97"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073624 - Lint all tools/profiler headers through clang-tidy r=profiler-reviewers,canova\n\nChanges includes:\n- making deleted methods public\n- making some methods default\n- rework some include dependencies to make header self contained\n\nAll changes were detected either by header compilation failure, or by\nclang-tidy.\n\nFixes are either generated by clang-tidy or hand-made\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327464\n", "files": ["tools/profiler/public/GeckoProfiler.h", "tools/profiler/public/GeckoProfilerReporter.h", "tools/profiler/public/ProfilerCounts.h", "tools/profiler/public/ProfilerRustBindings.h"], "git_node": "ee61e094f754c092f52995726c4c0a48d588941e", "git_parents": ["1c96511df8ae667482f0c295c092ac34d3746189"], "node": "1c32abcacf21fc8f62c5f9b1ddd33ffd637e885a", "parents": ["c402e35d16885bdee64fb9bdc5e0d896225ec62e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073030 - Make all security/ headers analyzable by clang-tidy r=sandbox-reviewers,jld,keeler\n\nThis basically mean making every header self-contained.\n\nAll changes were detected either by header compilation failure, based on\ncompilation flags from moz.build.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326959\n", "files": ["security/certverifier/CertVerifier.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/PublicSSL.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsClientAuthRemember.h", "security/sandbox/linux/SandboxInfo.h", "security/sandbox/linux/SandboxProfilerObserver.h", "security/sandbox/linux/broker/SandboxBrokerPolicyFactory.cpp"], "git_node": "3567240531500222b725bd47c6d791113ae58135", "git_parents": ["ee61e094f754c092f52995726c4c0a48d588941e"], "node": "024703c34bc1a4b6e2dd45eeb6df7d92dd2bb7cc", "parents": ["1c32abcacf21fc8f62c5f9b1ddd33ffd637e885a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073090 - Lint all toolkit/ headers through clang-tidy r=extension-reviewers,places-reviewers,dom-core-reviewers,emz,niklas,chumphreys,mccr8,robwu\n\nChanges includes:\n- making deleted methods public\n- change linkage of functions defined in header\n- rework some include dependencies to make header self contained\n\nAll changes were detected either by header compilation failure, or\nby clang-tidy.\n\nFixes are either generated by clang-tidy or hand-made\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326958\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/antitracking/PartitioningExceptionList.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/URLQueryStringStripper.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/bouncetrackingprotection/BounceTrackingProtectionStorage.cpp", "toolkit/components/antitracking/bouncetrackingprotection/BounceTrackingProtectionStorage.h", "toolkit/components/content-classifier/ContentClassifierService.h", "toolkit/components/content-classifier/content_classifier_engine/ContentClassifierEngine.h", "toolkit/components/extensions/webidl-api/ExtensionAPIBase.h", "toolkit/components/extensions/webidl-api/ExtensionEventManager.h", "toolkit/components/glean/bindings/jog/JOG.cpp", "toolkit/components/glean/bindings/private/TimingDistributionStandalone.h", "toolkit/components/places/SyncedBookmarksMirror.h", "toolkit/components/places/nsNavHistoryResult.cpp", "toolkit/components/sessionstore/SessionStoreListener.h", "toolkit/components/telemetry/core/Telemetry.cpp", "toolkit/components/terminator/nsTerminator.h", "toolkit/components/url-classifier/Classifier.cpp", "toolkit/components/url-classifier/ProtocolParser.cpp", "toolkit/profile/nsToolkitProfileService.cpp"], "git_node": "ef92d28ec51fab11f10a2959b1c2cc658a5daaba", "git_parents": ["3567240531500222b725bd47c6d791113ae58135"], "node": "ac0236b9c2de2b95574a8bcc88ccc09f948a82fe", "parents": ["024703c34bc1a4b6e2dd45eeb6df7d92dd2bb7cc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073030 - Make xpfe headers self contained r=emilio\n\nThis unlocks static analysis of every header in xpfe.\nIt turns out clang-tidy did not find anything under xpfe/ ^^!\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326951\n", "files": ["xpfe/appshell/nsIWindowMediator.idl"], "git_node": "87d45e835fd0fbee54d24a96ae8a8cd9cb235a18", "git_parents": ["ef92d28ec51fab11f10a2959b1c2cc658a5daaba"], "node": "191e4aa992f7db991f3af120c3152a2c3a6ff514", "parents": ["ac0236b9c2de2b95574a8bcc88ccc09f948a82fe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2073623 - Fill in JSFunction slot names. r=jonco\" for causing SM bustages in findPath.js.\n\nThis reverts commit 1c96511df8ae667482f0c295c092ac34d3746189.\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/JSObject.cpp"], "git_node": "70280b80f3fd2950657ae44abd3e3a9f1cccf478", "git_parents": ["87d45e835fd0fbee54d24a96ae8a8cd9cb235a18"], "node": "5f7a7b243a415d9de3ee79cfed5cfbba46404fb3", "parents": ["191e4aa992f7db991f3af120c3152a2c3a6ff514"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073465 - Tweak font-size quantization to prefer snapping to integer appUnit sizes. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,dshin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327426\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/values/specified/font.rs", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-inline/firefox-bug-2073465-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-inline/firefox-bug-2073465.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-values/update-subpixel-rem-unit.html", "widget/tests/test_textScaleFactor_system_font.html"], "git_node": "cb98be2d80bc300d58dbfb717ea4d027c58262a6", "git_parents": ["70280b80f3fd2950657ae44abd3e3a9f1cccf478"], "node": "ebdda4320f9769912a03e09d92efebddb9264b2d", "parents": ["5f7a7b243a415d9de3ee79cfed5cfbba46404fb3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge Mozilla-central to autoland\n", "files": [], "git_node": "667515f5faaa0cffdd1405b29942a4e544db242e", "git_parents": ["cb98be2d80bc300d58dbfb717ea4d027c58262a6", "4452e9a17a29f762c5af6326f45c000dcf3117bb"], "node": "7983f9c06ef5a891cf74509848459d30d49684b0", "parents": ["ebdda4320f9769912a03e09d92efebddb9264b2d", "8e40c4fb7992bc1a2eb4b54084d6e71b145321ac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068443 - Make `HTMLEditor` verify `Text` data after modifying it and abort for any errors r=smaug,m_kato\n\nThis patch makes `HandleInsertText` and `WhiteSpaceVisibilityKeeper`\nget `NS_ERROR_EDITOR_UNEXPECTED_DOM_TREE` once the target `Text` is\nmodified as unexpected data. Therefore, the callers of modifying a\n`Text` with transaction will abort handling it to avoid to keep handling\nit with unexpected DOM tree.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323542\n", "files": ["dom/base/CharacterDataBuffer.cpp", "dom/base/CharacterDataBuffer.h", "dom/base/nsINode.h", "dom/base/test/gtest/TestCharacterDataBuffer.cpp", "dom/script/ScriptElement.cpp", "editor/libeditor/CompositionTransaction.cpp", "editor/libeditor/DeleteTextTransaction.cpp", "editor/libeditor/EditorBase.cpp", "editor/libeditor/EditorBase.h", "editor/libeditor/HTMLEditor.cpp", "editor/libeditor/InsertTextTransaction.cpp", "editor/libeditor/ReplaceTextTransaction.cpp"], "git_node": "64bc200bd6f343e92cc8c7bb1946efdac9b728a3", "git_parents": ["667515f5faaa0cffdd1405b29942a4e544db242e"], "node": "579e431de917185e1464e884ea6042b4aee4d975", "parents": ["7983f9c06ef5a891cf74509848459d30d49684b0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065096. Enable image.jxl.enabled pref by default. r=saschanaz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326823\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml"], "git_node": "a1c836a605e000ad6a3dfb816a6e207de5d73617", "git_parents": ["64bc200bd6f343e92cc8c7bb1946efdac9b728a3"], "node": "2b05620098f42bead5a143808f36c973b07ed1f0", "parents": ["579e431de917185e1464e884ea6042b4aee4d975"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073321. Back out the local jxl_simd workaround so the 0.7.4 vendor bump is a pure upstream delta. r=supply-chain-reviewers,gfx-reviewers,bhood,lsalzman\n\nThis backs out the bug 2043090 macOS x86_64 workaround.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327216\n", "files": ["Cargo.lock", "Cargo.toml", "supply-chain/config.toml", "third_party/rust/jxl_simd/Cargo.toml", "third_party/rust/jxl_simd/src/x