e.\n\nThe ignore entry for python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test is anchored at topsrcdir, so\na checkout nested inside the tree reintroduces the deliberately broken manifest\nfixture it exists to hide, and mach try fuzzy with a path fails on it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327688\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/frontend/reader.py"], "git_node": "37b3e86d96e150887fef81524ab249e1836a8d08", "git_parents": ["da7b7e45b4347392c10864574dd6c713f8fbe167"], "node": "5986084ed4d96b56dbc35c59d37bd7224b162e00", "parents": ["f6ff7c89bbc70d984f842cc8a1025beaafefdd9b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073876 - Update PDF.js to ccd820e124d5ad5efdc8dad2a13b69adc2f7804a r=pdfjs-reviewers,calixte\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327687\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/PdfJsVersion.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.scripting.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.worker.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer-geckoview.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "a67ef2184bf94a743e481c31b78debe0292ce448", "git_parents": ["37b3e86d96e150887fef81524ab249e1836a8d08"], "node": "7829a5f48a7358716ffe1e043802b8f0c0b31930", "parents": ["5986084ed4d96b56dbc35c59d37bd7224b162e00"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e 169e5b51c9250c34217af441fc231be2ac608b9b\naf -\u003e 169e5b51c9250c34217af441fc231be2ac608b9b\nan -\u003e 169e5b51c9250c34217af441fc231be2ac608b9b\nar -\u003e 169e5b51c9250c34217af441fc231be2ac608b9b\nast -\u003e 169e5b51c9250c34217af441fc231be2ac608b9b\naz -\u003e 169e5b51c92