item in browser screen's menu r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326993\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/collections/SaveToCollectionMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/BrowserMenuBuilder.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/collections/SaveToCollectionMenuItemProviderTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/config/detekt-baseline.xml"], "git_node": "3fbebf5fe5fb3d8986333d354dec07c9116e78c1", "git_parents": ["ae91a4391f5fe3fc4c6dbaa2d3b43b595d039edb"], "node": "c24b61b59106ea4b8c9e88d8e948ccfeed8da9bf", "parents": ["aa35cee53f0451d4778258c8941dc35c97a30e46"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069858 - part 1 - Show the \"Open in app\" menu item in browser screen's menu r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326994\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/applinks/OpenInAppMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/BrowserMenuBuilder.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/applinks/OpenInAppMenuItemProviderTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "f6564e82c25920eaa8d199d375425c6faccea61c", "git_parents": ["3fbebf5fe5fb3d8986333d354dec07c9116e78c1"], "node": "5b22c665fe17d1dd51e6ae634703f97f8dee6bf7", "parents": ["c24b61b59106ea4b8c9e88d8e948ccfeed8da9bf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069858 - part 2 - Highlight more when submenu items are highlighted r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nUntil now More would be highlighted based on clear rules checked internally and only when it\ncontained as submenu items the summarize page.\nThese changes add support for the More item being highlighted when any of its other childs\nare highlighted.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326995\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/menu/MoreMenuItemsProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/BrowserMenuBuilder.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/ExpandableMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/menu/MoreMenuItemsProviderTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/BrowserMenuBuilderTest.kt"], "git_node": "f3884c365b0e39047bdba1aaf6a9600efd6c5997", "git_parents": ["f6564e82c25920eaa8d199d375425c6faccea61c"], "node": "871d43394b84ffc17c079a92209370a7457eb3ae", "parents": ["5b22c665fe17d1dd51e6ae634703f97f8dee6bf7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069860 - Show the \"Save as PDF\" menu item in browser screen's menu r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326997\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/BrowserMenuBuilder.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/store/MenuAction.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/store/MenuStore.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/pdf/SaveAsPdfMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/pdf/SaveAsPdfMenuItemProviderTest.kt"], "git_node": "918de2dd7609665219474fdac7d7ea8d0c49f29b", "git_parents": ["f3884c365b0e39047bdba1aaf6a9600efd6c5997"], "node": "ed6c702b28670f1cf5f2bc42b476e3efa1533527", "parents": ["871d43394b84ffc17c079a92209370a7457eb3ae"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069861 - Show the print menu item in browser screen's menu r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326998\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/BrowserMenuBuilder.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuSectionConfiguration.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/store/MenuAction.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/store/MenuStore.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/print/PrintMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/middleware/MenuMiddlewareTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/print/PrintMenuItemProviderTest.kt"], "git_node": "e4b5b799cd20c90a4124a71b203efd763044b377", "git_parents": ["918de2dd7609665219474fdac7d7ea8d0c49f29b"], "node": "815a28583a455759ae34f3b4a318f97fe1aac6e8", "parents": ["ed6c702b28670f1cf5f2bc42b476e3efa1533527"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Heitor Neiva \u003chneiva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1949431 - Publish Fenix releases to the Huawei AppGallery r=releng-reviewers,bhearsum\n\nAdd a push-apks task targeting the Huawei AppGallery, alongside the existing Samsung Galaxy Store push. Fenix release only (no Focus).\n\nAlso simplified the configuration both tasks share into task-defaults. The generated task definitions are identical before and after, at both level 1 and level 3.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325732\n", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/kinds.md", "taskcluster/kinds/push-apks/kind.yml"], "git_node": "86efd6d11576b84ca56cb02dd30bb4ecb67c0c79", "git_parents": ["e4b5b799cd20c90a4124a71b203efd763044b377"], "node": "a60a5cfa8fc7036972a2cae1ca201984e586d5aa", "parents": ["815a28583a455759ae34f3b4a318f97fe1aac6e8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Heitor Neiva \u003chneiva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072407 - Merge the push-apks and push-bundle kinds into push-android r=releng-reviewers,taskgraph-reviewers,jcristau\n\nBoth kinds ran the same six transforms against the same pushapk worker type and\ndiffered only in which signing kind they consumed and which store they targeted,\nso they become one kind with one task per store.\n\nTasks are now named after their store rather than after their signing\ndependency:\n\n    push-apks-fenix-release        -\u003e push-android-samsung-fenix-release\n    push-apks-focus-release        -\u003e push-android-samsung-focus-release\n    push-apks-fenix-release-huawei -\u003e push-android-huawei-fenix-release\n    push-bundle-\u003cbuild-type\u003e       -\u003e push-android-google-\u003cbuild-type\u003e\n\n`from-deps` names a task after its signing dependency, which every store pushing\na given build type shares, so each task instead carries a `label` template that\nthe `task_context` transforms fill in, `{name}` being the build type `from-deps`\nassigned. The store is also recorded in a `target-store` attribute. Treeherder\nsymbols follow the same scheme: push-google, push-samsung and push-huawei, with\n-f and -kl variants for Focus and Klar. Focus nightly and beta previously shared\nthe plain Google Play symbol with Fenix; they now take the -f variant like every\nother Focus task.\n\nThe generated task definitions are otherwise unchanged, bar two things. Google\nPlay tasks send `target_store: \"google\"` explicitly, which pushapkscript\nvalidates against the channel config rather than inferring from it. And dropping\n`run-on-repo-type` widens `run_on_repo_type` from `hg` to its `git, hg` default,\nmaking these tasks eligible on a git-based repository; nothing schedules them\nthere today. Every payload is identical at both level 1 and level 3, including\nthe per-store `commit` values.\n\nTwo consumers follow the rename. The googleplay action now also requires\n`target-store` to be \"google\", so it cannot pick up a Samsung or Huawei task.\nrelease-notify-push, release-version-bump and release-notify-ship collect their\ndependencies by `shipping-product`, so they now wait on the Samsung and Huawei\npushes as well as on Google Play; previously only Google Play gated the ship\nphase.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326332\n", "files": ["taskcluster/docs/attributes.md", "taskcluster/docs/kinds.md", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/actions/googleplay.py", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/test/test_actions.py", "taskcluster/kinds/push-android/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/push-apks/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/push-bundle/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/release-notify-push/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/release-notify-ship/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/release-version-bump/kind.yml"], "git_node": "317ee5da72ef1df08e167e32de4c4a3364777976", "git_parents": ["86efd6d11576b84ca56cb02dd30bb4ecb67c0c79"], "node": "35eed8c950c05d4467f0c03ea8b38bab7a724787", "parents": ["a60a5cfa8fc7036972a2cae1ca201984e586d5aa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julian Seward \u003cjseward@acm.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072424 - Wasm stack-map validation asserts on a deferred local operand. r=bvisness.\n\nRecent work on adding stackmaps for debug mode exposed a bogus assertion in\nbaseline's stackmap generator `StackMapGenerator::createStackMap`.  This\nasserts that `v.offs() \u003c= framePushedAtEntryToBody.value()` for `Stk::Local*`\nentries, but such entries do not have an `offs` field and so `v.offs()` fails\n(not this assertion).\n\nThis patch\n\n* removes the assertion\n\n* adds comments explaining why the assertion can't be applied to `Stk::Mem*`\n  entries, which would seem to be the obvious candidate for it\n\n* as a ridealong, slightly improves debug printing for the compiler's eval\n  stack (`showStackElem` and new function `ShowStack`).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327826\n", "files": ["js/src/wasm/WasmBCFrame.cpp", "js/src/wasm/WasmBCStk.h"], "git_node": "f5abb23ccbfa8118eb05b02ea5abc0652800783b", "git_parents": ["317ee5da72ef1df08e167e32de4c4a3364777976"], "node": "88e303cf2dc2aa3efcdb25402b665cde01eb5209", "parents": ["35eed8c950c05d4467f0c03ea8b38bab7a724787"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Leo Tenenbaum \u003cltenenbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072731 - Parsing actions for Declarative Web Push. r=saschanaz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327366\n", "files": ["Cargo.lock", "dom/push/Declarative.cpp", "dom/push/rust/Cargo.toml", "dom/push/rust/cbindgen.toml", "dom/push/rust/src/declarative_push.rs", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/tests/notifications/resources/MockAlertsService.js", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/tests/push-api/declarative.https.any.js"], "git_node": "9a8fe2eb871bec6e83459395a60f5100074e17a9", "git_parents": ["f5abb23ccbfa8118eb05b02ea5abc0652800783b"], "node": "a74c7c8df874d756fcdfc588bbabdfe94ac722ad", "parents": ["88e303cf2dc2aa3efcdb25402b665cde01eb5209"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jeff Muizelaar \u003cjmuizelaar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073623 - Fill in JSFunction slot names. r=jonco\n\nIn my recent heap dump JSFunction was the most common type\nwith UNKNOWN SLOTS. This makes heap dumps a little nicer to read.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327463\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/heap-analysis/findPath.js", "js/src/vm/JSObject.cpp"], "git_node": "4ff191a2dd8611f4963c04cac5beb217a6f0638f", "git_parents": ["9a8fe2eb871bec6e83459395a60f5100074e17a9"], "node": "c3ac0fc9a756570fc909f9ae227101ae12be7c16", "parents": ["a74c7c8df874d756fcdfc588bbabdfe94ac722ad"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nora Liu \u003cnliu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1276097 - Add a bytecode sanity check r=spidermonkey-reviewers,iain\n\nAdd debug-only sanity checks for TryNotes and ScopeNotes, run once per\nscript right after bytecode emission finishes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327400\n", "files": ["js/src/frontend/BytecodeEmitter.cpp", "js/src/frontend/BytecodeSection.cpp", "js/src/frontend/BytecodeSection.h", "js/src/vm/StencilEnums.h"], "git_node": "8599dc04c3cdedc7d99e1cffa6cad507a9305924", "git_parents": ["4ff191a2dd8611f4963c04cac5beb217a6f0638f"], "node": "56f25043ec82892bdf73d68ab9037120dd83e7c5", "parents": ["c3ac0fc9a756570fc909f9ae227101ae12be7c16"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Releas