47b22d5bf7a767d774887f58da8e139e4a3", "parents": ["289ffa4de2f16bef164a66f0ea79cfff44402688"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2072216 - [devtools] Add type checking to new settings panel r=Standard8\" for causing failures at browser_all_files_referenced.js.\n\nThis reverts commit 31d19efa54330e9718b4c4dcb9abec1c44394624.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2072146 - [devtools] add pref and toggle settings panel redesign r=devtools-reviewers,nchevobbe,fluent-reviewers,bolsson\"\n\nThis reverts commit af49390bed7672aecfa8930b106e8071076dc8e3.\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "devtools/client/definitions.js", "devtools/client/framework/test/browser.toml", "devtools/client/framework/test/browser_toolbox_settings_redesign_enabled.js", "devtools/client/jar.mn", "devtools/client/locales-preview/settings.ftl", "devtools/client/locales/jar.mn", "devtools/client/moz.build", "devtools/client/settings/index.html", "devtools/client/settings/moz.build", "devtools/client/settings/panel.js", "devtools/client/settings/tsconfig.json", "eslint-rollouts.config.mjs", "taskcluster/kinds/source-test/mozlint.yml", "tools/lint/typescript.yml"], "git_node": "0301a3e3e6f09933b0703b938d4397ccccc50a18", "git_parents": ["c0be59cce455e8876efa0391a26fcf760e19911c"], "node": "8c53ca459150c25e9f10726cde2d4e1bf7a10796", "parents": ["2bd6147b22d5bf7a767d774887f58da8e139e4a3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073789 - Keep the TestCrashHandler process alive until it has delivered its result. r=geckoview-reviewers,ohall\n\nsetEvalNextCrashDump posts the request to the client's HandlerThread. When the test body is skipped by an\nassumption, as ContentCrashTest is on the isolated-process variants, teardown runs disconnect() and nulls\nmService before that runnable executes, so it dies with a NullPointerException on a background thread and\ntakes the whole instrumentation process with it. Messenger.send is a Binder call that works from any thread,\nso send the request inline; only the reply needs the HandlerThread.\n\nGeckoView launches the handler with startForegroundService, and onStartCommand reports the result and calls\nstopSelf without ever calling startForeground, which Android 14 treats as a contract violation and kills the\n:crash process with ForegroundServiceDidNotStartInTimeException. That kill shows up several times in every run\nand is the likely cause of a ParentCrashTest#crashParent timeout where the result never arrived. Call\nstartForeground with a minimal notification first, and declare the service type the manifest needs for it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327716\n", "files": ["mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/AndroidManifest.xml", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/TestCrashHandler.java"], "git_node": "51b0cc877443b4ccc0997132bae8836e5d4c445c", "git_parents": ["0301a3e3e6f09933b0703b938d4397ccccc50a18"], "node": "80edbd34e5d50b35041bfac789ed9951d274889e", "parents": ["8c53ca459150c25e9f10726cde2d4e1bf7a10796"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072670 - Keep showing the New Tab search bar's engine wordmarks in dark mode and update page cutout background. r=mconley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327765\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/content/SearchModeSwitcher.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-newtab/browser_engineWordmark.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Search/_Search.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/styles/_variables.scss", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/engine-wordmarks/Bing.svg", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/engine-wordmarks/DuckDuckGo.svg", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/engine-wordmarks/Perplexity.svg", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/engine-wordmarks/Wikipedia.svg"], "git_node": "5693444cccb2ff09ded0755f4b7bc191d90556e7", "git_parents": ["51b0cc877443b4ccc0997132bae8836e5d4c445c"], "node": "8e3a02349fac8d893e82388aad17d3ca1f3c9049", "parents": ["80edbd34e5d50b35041bfac789ed9951d274889e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072670 - Draw the New Tab search bar's search glass as the input box's background image. r=daleharvey\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327766\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css"], "git_node": "81a869c484b83692c0e4f0b243934f3556fe20e6", "git_parents": ["5693444cccb2ff09ded0755f4b7bc191d90556e7"], "node": "a82fa80be0a306f0999f4a890907ead681309cfa", "parents": ["8e3a02349fac8d893e82388aad17d3ca1f3c9049"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072670 - Add Startpage to the New Tab search bar's engine wordmarks. r=daleharvey,urlbar-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327847\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/content/SearchModeSwitcher.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-newtab/browser_engineWordmark.js", "browser/themes/shared/jar.inc.mn", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/engine-wordmarks/Startpage.svg"], "git_node": "a266b798f0cf996c4efa16a5884067b9c7e743e2", "git_parents": ["81a869c484b83692c0e4f0b243934f3556fe20e6"], "node": "a4dde72079e14d946f6ecd9f5d0641570a09fa3b", "parents": ["a82fa80be0a306f0999f4a890907ead681309cfa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Damien Carver [:dcarver] \u003cdcaver@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072590 - Add floating-point specialization for AddDebugAnnotationImpl in Perfetto.h r=canova\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327388\n", "files": ["tools/performance/Perfetto.h"], "git_node": "b567eece6070a272d8c69d84799029db79500383", "git_parents": ["a266b798f0cf996c4efa16a5884067b9c7e743e2"], "node": "8b336c43df60d5070eed178beaac120096e52634", "parents": ["a4dde72079e14d946f6ecd9f5d0641570a09fa3b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068234 - Make split view tabs selectable from the edge of the tab strip. r=kcochrane,desktop-theme-reviewers,tabbrowser-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327230\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser.toml", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_splitview_click_target.js", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tabs.css"], "git_node": "3140419d11c4ed59394182ea0274390be8bac194", "git_parents": ["b567eece6070a272d8c69d84799029db79500383"], "node": "70ad4fc723cfeeacc041ad75b5cb0a7f5ffcb9e5", "parents": ["8b336c43df60d5070eed178beaac120096e52634"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sotaro Ikeda \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072511 - Add support of headless mode with GPU process r=geckoview-reviewers,gtk-reviewers,gfx-reviewers,emilio,owlish,nical\n\nOn Android, gecko already tries to use HeadlessCompositorWidget in GPU process during gtest.It is done without setting \"MOZ_HEADLESS=1\" on Android. And caused crashes during gtest. See Bug 2072484.\n\nThe change addresses the crash.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326389\n", "files": ["gfx/ipc/GPUProcessHost.cpp", "gfx/ipc/RemoteCompositorSession.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/CompositorBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxPlatform.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/RenderCompositor.cpp", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "widget/CompositorWidget.h", "widget/android/AndroidCompositorWidget.h", "widget/android/CompositorWidgetChild.cpp", "widget/cocoa/CocoaCompositorWidget.h", "widget/cocoa/CompositorWidgetChild.cpp", "widget/gtk/CompositorWidgetChild.cpp", "widget/gtk/GtkCompositorWidget.h", "widget/headless/HeadlessCompositorWidget.h", "widget/headless/HeadlessCompositorWidgetParent.cpp", "widget/headless/HeadlessCompositorWidgetParent.h", "widget/headless/HeadlessWidget.cpp", "widget/headless/HeadlessWidget.h", "widget/headless/moz.build", "widget/nsIWidget.cpp", "widget/windows/CompositorWidgetChild.cpp", "widget/windows/CompositorWidgetChild.h", "widget/windows/CompositorWidgetParent.cpp", "widget/windows/CompositorWidgetParent.h", "widget/windows/PCompositorWidget.ipdl"], "git_node": "b09d7949a50abc8819a06eb67a2c78e6389e3ba0", "git_parents": ["3140419d11c4ed59394182ea0274390be8bac194"], "node": "13774c032df84e12623de62d7d32a6ecb17f5ba4", "parents": ["70ad4fc723cfeeacc041ad75b5cb0a7f5ffcb9e5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicholas Poon \u003cnpoon@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073556 - [HNT] Use the current homepage tab for paste and go context menu option r=android-reviewers,gl\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327427\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/toolbar/BrowserToolbarMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/toolbar/BrowserToolbarMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "51d0ee78b4282851ae2893bb4545f565a657a4d2", "git_parents": ["b09d7949a50abc8819a06eb67a2c78e6389e3ba0"], "node": "c4149cf99ef30760bc75cbc786fddbcb98997b15", "parents": ["13774c032df84e12623de62d7d32a6ecb17f5ba4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050211 - Make test 1780191-1.svg not rely on WebRender's incorrect snapping of SVG rectangles. r-#gfx-reviewers r=layout-reviewers,tnikkel\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326213\n", "files": ["layout/reftests/bugs/1780191-1-ref.svg", "layout/reftests/bugs/1780191-1.svg", "layout/reftests/bugs/reftest.list"], "git_node": "65bf38606968dbf9c1ab4e4f3dfc5ab01e83d248", "git_parents": ["51d0ee78b4282851ae2893bb4545f565a657a4d2"], "node": "f56294a6198a5c01b6b8fe09799c4ee9998d1262", "parents": ["c4149cf99ef30760bc75cbc786fddbcb98997b15"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050211 - Wire up AA for primitives that have the ANTIALIASING flag. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nThis used to work and got lost at some point.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310361\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs"], "git_node": "ff02306a5c15d8fdaef0d8b59c690b5d30fbd034", "git_parents": ["65bf38606968dbf9c1ab4e4f3dfc5ab01e83d248"], "node": "d9c53f618744b3558099f8e5658172a09bec7ee9", "parents": ["f56294a6198a5c01b6b8fe09799c4ee9998d1262"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050211 - Dont't snap anti-aliased primitives. r=gw\n\nAn anti-aliased SVG shape keeps its exact sub-pixel edges instead of\nlanding on the device pixel grid, so an edge that used to be crisp is\nresolved by the shader. Where the reference draws the same geometry at\na snapped position, what is left is a seam one pixel wide along that\nedge, and where the shape feeds a filter, a faint shift across the\nwhole filtered area. Fuzz the web-platform tests where that shows up.\nThe ranges start at 0, so they also hold where the edge still falls on\na whole pixel.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310363\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/clip.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/space.rs", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/floats-clear/float-replaced-height-006.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/floats-clear/float-replaced-width-007.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/floats-clear/float-replaced-width-008.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/floats-clear/float-replaced-width-009.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/block-replaced-height-006.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/block-replaced-width-002.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-height-006.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-height-009.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-width-002.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-width-003.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-width-007.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-width-008.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-height-006.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-height-009.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-width-002.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-width-003.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-width-008.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-width-009.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/compositing/mix-blend-mode/mix-blend-mode-svg.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-flexbox/svg-no-natural-size-grandchild.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-flexbox/svg-root-as-flex-item-001.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-flexbox/svg-root-as-flex-item-002.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-flexbox/svg-root-as-flex-item-003.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-flexbox/svg-root-as-flex-item-004.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-flexbox/svg-root-as-flex-item-005.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-images/object-position-svg-001e.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-images/object-position-svg-001o.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-images/object-position-svg-002e.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-images/object-position-svg-002o.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-sizing/intrinsic-ratio-replaced-box-sizing.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-001.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-002.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-003.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-004.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-006.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-007.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-008.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-009.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-010.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-011.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-012.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-013.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-014.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-015.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-016.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/scale/svg-scale-017.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewX/svg-skewx-001.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewX/svg-skewx-006.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewX/svg-skewx-011.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewX/svg-skewx-016.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewX/svg-skewx-021.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewX/svg-skewx-with-units.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewX/svg-skewxy-001.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewY/svg-skewy-001.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewY/svg-skewy-006.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewY/svg-skewy-011.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewY/svg-skewy-016.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewY/svg-skewy-021.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/skewY/svg-skewy-with-units.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-transforms/transform-percent-010.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/filter-effects/fecolormatrix-special-value.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/filter-effects/svg-filter-filter-units-user-space.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/svg/extensibility/foreignObject/will-change-in-transformed-foreign-object.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/svg/painting/inline-svg-resize-viewport-dependent-mask.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/svg/painting/inner-outer-svg-overflow-auto.html.ini"], "git_node": "6b3e7f49dd35932f228f4707e32590a82952fc4e", "git_parents": ["ff02306a5c15d8fdaef0d8b59c690b5d30fbd034"], "node": "9fd638010052bbf327f2c159fc6ad6d0abda132a", "parents": ["d9c53f618744b3558099f8e5658172a09bec7ee9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050211 - Add a wrench test. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310362\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/antialiased-ref.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/antialiased.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/yaml_frame_reader.rs"], "git_node": "e19a8107bca95be9abbc56f18a400e10c684fdda", "git_parents": ["6b3e7f49dd35932f228f4707e32590a82952fc4e"], "node": "aa83271c0c6918e16424d8b2a29b690e55c418bd", "parents": ["9fd638010052bbf327f2c159fc6ad6d0abda132a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050211 - Quantize reference frame origins in device space, not local space. r=gw\n\nThe 1/128 px quantization of reference frame origins (added to keep float\nnoise from the external scroll offset round-trip off the device-pixel snap\ntie) was applied to origin_in_parent_reference_frame at scene build time, in\nthe parent frame's local units. Under a scaled ancestor those units are not\ndevice pixels: SVG content sits under the outer \u003csvg\u003e's viewBox transform,\nso a rect with a CSS transform gets a nested reference frame whose origin\nis quantized to 1/128 of a user unit, i.e. scale/128 device pixels. With\nanti-aliased primitives no longer snapped, that error becomes visible.\n\nMove the quantization to the places where a device-space offset is about to\nbe rounded to a device pixel: snap_offset(), and the should_snap round of\nthe accumulated ScaleOffset in update_transform(). That keeps the snap-tie\nprotection while leaving unsnapped content at its exact position.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326214\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/spatial_node.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reference-frame-origin-scaled-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reference-frame-origin-scaled.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reftest.list"], "git_node": "877720c5c24a1defdd2c02e9146727b97e980781", "git_parents": ["e19a8107bca95be9abbc56f18a400e10c684fdda"], "node": "ed629a7a46a566f5754a99e2eaea044d364e19f0", "parents": ["aa83271c0c6918e16424d8b2a29b690e55c418bd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050211 - Honour shape-rendering: crispEdges for WebRender SVG rects. r=firefox-svg-reviewers,longsonr\n\nwhen crispEdges is used the primitive should not be anti-aliased.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326215\n", "files": ["layout/svg/SVGGeometryFrame.cpp"], "git_node": "8947db015ab946ec825e7484031a52ba8d1d8052", "git_parents": ["877720c5c24a1defdd2c02e9146727b97e980781"], "node": "81824f560f8402bdebbca12f92a097bba953a009", "parents": ["ed629a7a46a566f5754a99e2eaea044d364e19f0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050211: apply code formatting via Lando\n\n# ignore-this-changeset\n", "files": ["layout/svg/SVGGeometryFrame.cpp"], "git_node": "18be802fc4cf3cc32f5e78e09c93baf71a724c74", "git_parents": ["8947db015ab946ec825e7484031a52ba8d1d8052"], "node": "f0d2557eebb3574c0691a9a1b1f714562feec7fa", "parents": ["81824f560f8402bdebbca12f92a097bba953a009"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1994449 - Cookie expiration checks - part 1 - introduce Cookie::IsExpired(), r=valentin,cookie-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327831\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/cookiestore/CookieStoreParent.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/Cookie.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/Cookie.h", "netwerk/cookie/CookieService.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/CookieServiceChild.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/CookieStorage.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/nsICookieService.idl"], "git_node": "cba00f90669338a8e0beafae81c6d8801ef3d971", "git_parents": ["18be802fc4cf3cc32f5e78e09c93baf71a724c74"], "node": "159ab84e4b82886fbdfa0b8743f03e5d816d2088", "parents": ["f0d2557eebb3574c0691a9a1b1f714562feec7fa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1994449 - Cookie expiration checks - part 2 - improve hasExistingCookies(), r=valentin,cookie-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327832\n", "files": ["netwerk/cookie/CookieService.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/CookieService.h", "netwerk/cookie/CookieServiceChild.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/CookieStorage.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/CookieStorage.h", "netwerk/cookie/nsICookieService.idl"], "git_node": "cb7080f39fb371350a61c024c37017c35563327e", "git_parents": ["cba00f90669338a8e0beafae81c6d8801ef3d971"], "node": "b83c33f303e2e37cf6ecf9486d154e38b8f79d02", "parents": ["159ab84e4b82886fbdfa0b8743f03e5d816d2088"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1994449 - Cookie expiration checks - part 3 - improve countCookiesFromHost(), r=valentin,settings-reviewers,cookie-reviewers,Gijs\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327833\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/browser-pageinfo/browser_pageinfo_security.js", "browser/base/content/test/browser-siteIdentity/browser_identityPopup_clearSiteData.js", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policy_cookie_settings.js", "browser/components/preferences/tests/siteData/browser_siteData.js", "browser/modules/test/unit/test_SiteDataManager.js", "netwerk/cookie/CookieService.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/CookieStorage.h", "netwerk/cookie/nsICookieManager.idl", "netwerk/cookie/test/unit/test_eviction.js", "netwerk/test/gtest/TestCookie.cpp", "netwerk/test/mochitests/file_testloadflags_chromescript.js", "netwerk/test/unit/head_cookies.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_bug526789.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_bug650522.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_bug667087.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_cookie_partitioned_attribute.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_cookies_async_failure.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_cookies_partition_counting.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_cookies_privatebrowsing.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_cookies_profile_close.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_cookies_purge_counting_per_host.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_cookies_read.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_domain_eviction.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_invalid_cookie_fix.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_schema_10_migration.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_schema_12_migration.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_schema_13_db.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_schema_14_migration.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_schema_15_migration.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_schema_17_migration.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_schema_2_migration.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_schema_3_migration.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_suspend_channel_on_examine.js", "netwerk/test/unit/trr_common.js", "netwerk/test/unit_ipc/test_cookie_header_stripped.js", "toolkit/components/cleardata/tests/unit/test_cookies.js"], "git_node": "e38860eabc8a4f0b74b0fcf99c42646fd538cc9a", "git_parents": ["cb7080f39fb371350a61c024c37017c35563327e"], "node": "63caeb85efec5987abd310afa6783d0de6fbb598", "parents": ["b83c33f303e2e37cf6ecf9486d154e38b8f79d02"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1994449 - Cookie expiration checks - part 4 - improve hasCookiesForSite(), r=valentin,cookie-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327834\n", "files": ["netwerk/cookie/CookieService.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/CookieStorage.cpp", "netwerk/cookie/CookieStorage.h", "netwerk/test/gtest/TestCookie.cpp"], "git_node": "49446aacc446c00cac59bf2b267d76b12360f365", "git_parents": ["e38860eabc8a4f0b74b0fcf99c42646fd538cc9a"], "node": "66ad8bf12635be4bb2218f7125c2c5987ccb52cd", "parents": ["63caeb85efec5987abd310afa6783d0de6fbb598"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Yubin Jamora \u003cyjamora@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071928 - Flipped pref toolbar panel enabled on for Smart Window Monitor r=ngrato\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326220\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AIWindow.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_monitor_button.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_monitor_button_panel.js"], "git_node": "2b7d1cb9f258d62dd9e38807417e144bdc237b63", "git_parents": ["49446aacc446c00cac59bf2b267d76b12360f365"], "node": "e0f8e6a40048ab0c8676415816eec70291bcdad0", "parents": ["66ad8bf12635be4bb2218f7125c2c5987ccb52cd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Javier Fern  ndez Garc  a-Boente \u003cjfernandez@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061233 - Add service worker tests for data clearing and tracker purging r=dom-worker-reviewers,timhuang,asuth,edenchuang\n\nAdds browser-chrome tests covering the data-lifecycle paths that remove\nservice worker registrations and their Cache API storage:\n\n- nsIClearDataService removes a registration and its Cache storage by\n  principal, by site and by time range, leaving an unrelated origin intact.\n  These are the paths that \"Forget About This Site\" and \"Clear Recent\n  History\" rely on.\n- PurgeTrackerService removes a classified tracker's registration and Cache\n  storage, while a non-tracker origin is preserved.\n\nThe existing coverage does not reach service workers: the antitracking\nxpcshell purge tests (test_purge_trackers.js) assert cookies, localStorage\nand IndexedDB, and browser_pbm_cleanup.js only covers the private-browsing\npath.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319846\n", "files": ["dom/serviceworkers/test/browser-common.toml", "dom/serviceworkers/test/browser_clearData_serviceWorkers.js", "dom/serviceworkers/test/browser_head.js", "dom/serviceworkers/test/browser_purgeTrackers_serviceWorkers.js", "dom/serviceworkers/test/utils.js"], "git_node": "b44de16b5a8a662c63033d691da179175974be49", "git_parents": ["2b7d1cb9f258d62dd9e38807417e144bdc237b63"], "node": "3952c71d0cbe6d8df75312206dce95f700876fe1", "parents": ["e0f8e6a40048ab0c8676415816eec70291bcdad0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074353 - Update android nightly application-services version bump to 1b81fb74dda7ec725fbeca8369ea7247fa884575 r=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328056\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/ApplicationServices.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "2a4e7c7612dc20ca2dc3465bb2dac57e2e903208", "git_parents": ["b44de16b5a8a662c63033d691da179175974be49"], "node": "66e5c493aa70ba855f288b9b0e5c5d5112682122", "parents": ["3952c71d0cbe6d8df75312206dce95f700876fe1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070824 - Add a `license-declarations` linter for the license declarations r=linter-reviewers,sergesanspaille,ahal\n\nChecks the LICENSES and LICENSED_UNDER declarations across the tree without\nrunning a build: every LICENSED_UNDER id must have a matching LICENSES\ndeclaration somewhere, and every `spdx` flag must be a valid SPDX expression.\nAn id declared twice is rejected by mozbuild.licenses, where the two\ndeclarations are still distinguishable, and is not checked again here.\n\nIt lives in tools/lint/license.yml, next to the `license` header check, rather\nthan in a `licenses.yml` a letter away from it: mozlint selects linters by\nconfiguration file name, so both run under `mach lint -l license` and in the\none taskgraph task, the way file-perm.yml groups its two checks.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325283\n", "files": ["docs/code-quality/lint/linters/license.md", "python/sites/lint.txt", "taskcluster/config.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/source-test/mozlint.yml", "tools/lint/license.yml", "tools/lint/license/__init__.py", "tools/lint/test/files/license-declarations/bad/bad.build", "tools/lint/test/files/license-declarations/bad/computed.build", "tools/lint/test/files/license-declarations/bad/duplicate.build", "tools/lint/test/files/license-declarations/bad/repeated.build", "tools/lint/test/files/license-declarations/bad/syntax.build", "tools/lint/test/files/license-declarations/good/assigned.mozbuild", "tools/lint/test/files/license-declarations/good/good.build", "tools/lint/test/python.toml", "tools/lint/test/test_file_license.py", "tools/lint/test/test_license_declarations.py"], "git_node": "90f4000cea42bad814d8411134f2b83694698a09", "git_parents": ["2a4e7c7612dc20ca2dc3465bb2dac57e2e903208"], "node": "188a69929fc15a78b0285fadc3e47ef27c3f0417", "parents": ["66e5c493aa70ba855f288b9b0e5c5d5112682122"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csledru@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070824 - Declare every about:license notice in moz.build r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ipc-reviewers,application-update-reviewers,media-playback-reviewers,credential-management-reviewers,webrtc-reviewers,devtools-reviewers,cubeb-reviewers,profiler-reviewers,win-reviewers,frontend-codestyle-reviewers,ai-platform-reviewers,sandbox-reviewers,crashreporting-reviewers,media-webspeech-reviewers,bobowen,dimi,canova,padenot,nchevobbe,mccr8,yjuglaret,bwc,ahochheiden\n\ntoolkit/content/license.html is a 6451-line preprocessed file holding all 96\nlicense notices, their path lists and their #ifdefs by hand. This moves that\ncontent to the directories that own the code; the page itself is still the\nchecked-in file until the next commits replace it.\n\nEach notice becomes a file next to the code it covers, or in\ntoolkit/content/licenses/ when the text is shared across the tree, plus a\nLICENSES declaration in the owning moz.build. Where one directory owns two\nnotices, gfx/skia owning both android and skia among them, the filename is\nqualified with the license id.\n\nThe per-entry #ifdefs are gone. Six block-level guards became CONFIG\nconditionals; the rest were guarding individual paths and are now implicit,\nsince a directory that is not built is never traversed.\n\nOf the 241 path entries, 52 are attributed by the directory itself and 112 by\ntheir nearest built ancestor. The remaining 77 live under third_party/ and\nnsprpub/, which the build system does not traverse, so they stay as explicit\npaths in toolkit/content/licenses/moz.build.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325284\n", "files": [".prettierignore", "browser/extensions/formautofill/moz.build", "build/moz.build", "devtools/client/debugger/dist/LICENSE-NOTICE-babel.txt", "devtools/client/debugger/dist/LICENSE-NOTICE-babylon.txt", "devtools/client/debugger/dist/moz.build", "devtools/client/debugger/moz.build", "devtools/client/inspector/markup/moz.build", "devtools/client/netmonitor/src/components/messages/parsers/moz.build", "devtools/client/netmonitor/src/utils/moz.build", "devtools/client/shared/sourceeditor/codemirror6/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "devtools/client/shared/sourceeditor/codemirror6/moz.build", "devtools/client/shared/sourceeditor/moz.build", "devtools/client/shared/vendor/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "devtools/client/shared/vendor/moz.build", "devtools/client/shared/widgets/moz.build", "devtools/shared/jsbeautify/moz.build", "devtools/shared/moz.build", "devtools/shared/network-observer/moz.build", "devtools/shared/storage/vendor/stringvalidator/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "devtools/shared/storage/vendor/stringvalidator/moz.build", "dom/media/systemservices/moz.build", "dom/media/webaudio/blink/moz.build", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/moz.build", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/test/moz.build", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/moz.build", "dom/moz.build", "editor/libeditor/moz.build", "extensions/auth/moz.build", "extensions/spellcheck/hunspell/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "extensions/spellcheck/hunspell/moz.build", "extensions/spellcheck/moz.build", "gfx/angle/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "gfx/angle/moz.build", "gfx/cairo/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "gfx/cairo/moz.build", "gfx/moz.build", "gfx/pixman/moz.build", "gfx/qcms/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "gfx/qcms/moz.build", "gfx/skia/LICENSE-NOTICE-android.txt", "gfx/skia/LICENSE-NOTICE-skia.txt", "gfx/skia/moz.build", "gfx/thebes/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "gfx/thebes/moz.build", "gfx/vr/service/openvr/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "gfx/vr/service/openvr/moz.build", "gfx/ycbcr/moz.build", "intl/components/src/calendar/moz.build", "intl/moz.build", "ipc/chromium/moz.build", "ipc/chromium/src/third_party/moz.build", "js/src/builtin/moz.build", "js/src/ctypes/moz.build", "js/src/irregexp/moz.build", "js/src/jit/moz.build", "js/src/util/moz.build", "js/src/vm/moz.build", "js/src/vtune/moz.build", "js/src/xsum/moz.build", "js/src/zydis/moz.build", "media/libcubeb/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "media/libcubeb/moz.build", "media/libnestegg/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "media/libnestegg/moz.build", "media/libnestegg/src/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "media/libnestegg/src/moz.build", "media/libogg/moz.build", "media/libsoundtouch/src/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "media/libsoundtouch/src/moz.build", "media/libspeex_resampler/moz.build", "media/libvorbis/moz.build", "media/libvpx/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "media/libvpx/moz.build", "media/libyuv/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "media/libyuv/moz.build", "memory/build/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "memory/build/moz.build", "mfbt/moz.build", "mfbt/tests/gtest/moz.build", "modules/fdlibm/src/moz.build", "modules/woff2/moz.build", "mozglue/baseprofiler/moz.build", "netwerk/dns/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "netwerk/dns/moz.build", "netwerk/sctp/src/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "netwerk/sctp/src/moz.build", "netwerk/wifi/moz.build", "other-licenses/snappy/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "other-licenses/snappy/moz.build", "parser/expat/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "parser/expat/moz.build", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/vendor/vendor_manifest.py", "security/moz.build", "security/sandbox/moz.build", "third_party/js/prosemirror/moz.build", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz.build", "third_party/llama.cpp/moz.build", "third_party/msgpack/moz.build", "third_party/perfetto/moz.build", "third_party/zstd/moz.build", "third_party/zucchini/moz.build", "toolkit/components/formautofill/moz.build", "toolkit/components/jsoncpp/moz.build", "toolkit/components/ml/moz.build", "toolkit/components/passwordmgr/moz.build", "toolkit/components/protobuf/moz.build", "toolkit/components/reputationservice/moz.build", "toolkit/components/resistfingerprinting/moz.build", "toolkit/components/url-classifier/moz.build", "toolkit/content/licenses/acorn.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/apache-llvm.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/apache.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/apple-password-rules-parser.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/apple.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/arm.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/boost.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/bsd2clause.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/bsd3clause.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/bspatch.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/chromium.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/codemirror.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/cryptogams.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/cubic-bezier.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/d3.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/dagre-d3.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/diff.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/disconnect.me.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/dtoa.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/dxcompiler-deps.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/firebug.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/gears-istumbler.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/gfx-font-list.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/google-bsd.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/gyp.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/harfbuzz.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/hunspell-ee.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/hunspell-en.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/hunspell-lt.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/hunspell-nl.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/hunspell-ru.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/immutable.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/jquery.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/k_exp.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/lgpl.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/libc++.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/libevent.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/libffi.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/libjingle.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/llvm.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/lodash.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/mit.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/moz.build", "toolkit/content/licenses/mpl.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/nicer.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/nom.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/nrappkit-cont-1.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/nrappkit-cont-2.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/nrappkit-cont-3.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/nrappkit.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/openvision.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/praton.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/praton1.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/prosemirror.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/qrcode-generator.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/react-redux.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/react.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/redux.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/sprintf.js.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/sunsoft.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/superfasthash.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/twemoji.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/ucal.html", "toolkit/content/licenses/unicase.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/unicode-v3.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/unicode.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/v8.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/vtune.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/webrtc.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/x264.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/xdg.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/xiph.txt", "toolkit/content/moz.build", "toolkit/crashreporter/moz.build", "toolkit/mozapps/update/updater/bspatch/moz.build", "tools/lint/file-whitespace.yml", "tools/lint/license.yml", "tools/profiler/moz.build", "widget/cocoa/moz.build", "widget/windows/moz.build", "xpcom/base/moz.build", "xpcom/io/moz.build"], "git_node": "d9a76c0abc6667c48e400457ef3e74460b746938", "git_parents": ["90f4000cea42bad814d8411134f2b83694698a09"], "node": "7555c0892bc8634998af56b99806f192b3419139", "parents": ["188a69929fc15a78b0285fadc3e47ef27c3f0417"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csledru@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070824 - Render about:license from the LICENSES declarations r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nlicense.html.mako and gen_license_html.py render the page from licenses.json\nthrough GENERATED_FILES, so jar.mn no longer needs the preprocessor. Firefox\nkeeps its own copy, the shared page plus the Mozilla binaries notice, which\njar.mn goes on overriding chrome://global/content/license.html with.\n\nA notice stored as a .txt is wrapped in \u003cpre\u003e and escaped; one that carries\nmarkup of its own is stored as .html and emitted verbatim. Nine do, including\nthe MPL and the LGPLs.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325285\n", "files": ["browser/base/jar.mn", "browser/base/moz.build", "toolkit/content/gen_license_html.py", "toolkit/content/jar.mn", "toolkit/content/license.html.mako", "toolkit/content/moz.build", "tools/lint/license.yml", "tools/lint/license/__init__.py", "tools/lint/test/files/license-declarations/bad/bad.build", "tools/lint/test/test_license_declarations.py"], "git_node": "284673c8beb4e8366aeef8eeaf751218cc923084", "git_parents": ["d9a76c0abc6667c48e400457ef3e74460b746938"], "node": "f1c9855c704b529eca740995f91bbd087b59a816", "parents": ["7555c0892bc8634998af56b99806f192b3419139"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csledru@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070824 - Remove the hand-maintained license.html r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille,frontend-codestyle-reviewers\n\nThe page is generated now, so the preprocessed file goes away.\n\nIt carries the same data as before. Comparing the union across all four\nplatforms the old file knew about, with every feature flag on, against the\nunion rendered from licenses.json: same 96 rows, no title changed, no path\ndropped, and every license body preserved, modulo ten notices where a named\ncharacter entity is now stored decoded (&copy; as the literal character),\nwhich renders identically.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325286\n", "files": [".prettierignore", "toolkit/content/license.html"], "git_node": "3531a0ae7698c93e98a60074dfee8cc8dad04e4d", "git_parents": ["284673c8beb4e8366aeef8eeaf751218cc923084"], "node": "bf0efe769b3c41545e86a556930025b1b8ffac7b", "parents": ["f1c9855c704b529eca740995f91bbd087b59a816"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2072511 - Add support of headless mode with GPU process r=geckoview-reviewers,gtk-reviewers,gfx-reviewers,emilio,owlish,nical\" for causing bustages in HeadlessCompositorWidgetParent.h.\n\nThis reverts commit b09d7949a50abc8819a06eb67a2c78e6389e3ba0.\n", "files": ["gfx/ipc/GPUProcessHost.cpp", "gfx/ipc/RemoteCompositorSession.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/CompositorBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxPlatform.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/RenderCompositor.cpp", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "widget/CompositorWidget.h", "widget/android/AndroidCompositorWidget.h", "widget/android/CompositorWidgetChild.cpp", "widget/cocoa/CocoaCompositorWidget.h", "widget/cocoa/CompositorWidgetChild.cpp", "widget/gtk/CompositorWidgetChild.cpp", "widget/gtk/GtkCompositorWidget.h", "widget/headless/HeadlessCompositorWidget.h", "widget/headless/HeadlessCompositorWidgetParent.cpp", "widget/headless/HeadlessCompositorWidgetParent.h", "widget/headless/HeadlessWidget.cpp", "widget/headless/HeadlessWidget.h", "widget/headless/moz.build", "widget/nsIWidget.cpp", "widget/windows/CompositorWidgetChild.cpp", "widget/windows/CompositorWidgetChild.h", "widget/windows/CompositorWidgetParent.cpp", "widget/windows/CompositorWidgetParent.h", "widget/windows/PCompositorWidget.ipdl"], "git_node": "63573011ef08f5df6a990af1484ba7f33a6a9c69", "git_parents": ["3531a0ae7698c93e98a60074dfee8cc8dad04e4d"], "node": "9dc792e9d22708d6e13d6765b1e6954df8ebe51c", "parents": ["bf0efe769b3c41545e86a556930025b1b8ffac7b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2070824 - Remove the hand-maintained license.html r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille,frontend-codestyle-reviewers\" for causing build bustages at license.html\n\nThis reverts commit 3531a0ae7698c93e98a60074dfee8cc8dad04e4d.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070824 - Render about:license from the LICENSES declarations r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\"\n\nThis reverts commit 284673c8beb4e8366aeef8eeaf751218cc923084.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070824 - Declare every about:license notice in moz.build r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ipc-reviewers,application-update-reviewers,media-playback-reviewers,credential-management-reviewers,webrtc-reviewers,devtools-reviewers,cubeb-reviewers,profiler-reviewers,win-reviewers,frontend-codestyle-reviewers,ai-platform-reviewers,sandbox-reviewers,crashreporting-reviewers,media-webspeech-reviewers,bobowen,dimi,canova,padenot,nchevobbe,mccr8,yjuglaret,bwc,ahochheiden\"\n\nThis reverts commit d9a76c0abc6667c48e400457ef3e74460b746938.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070824 - Add a `license-declarations` linter for the license declarations r=linter-reviewers,sergesanspaille,ahal\"\n\nThis reverts commit 90f4000cea42bad814d8411134f2b83694698a09.\n", "files": [".prettierignore", "browser/base/jar.mn", "browser/base/moz.build", "browser/extensions/formautofill/moz.build", "build/moz.build", "devtools/client/debugger/dist/LICENSE-NOTICE-babel.txt", "devtools/client/debugger/dist/LICENSE-NOTICE-babylon.txt", "devtools/client/debugger/dist/moz.build", "devtools/client/debugger/moz.build", "devtools/client/inspector/markup/moz.build", "devtools/client/netmonitor/src/components/messages/parsers/moz.build", "devtools/client/netmonitor/src/utils/moz.build", "devtools/client/shared/sourceeditor/codemirror6/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "devtools/client/shared/sourceeditor/codemirror6/moz.build", "devtools/client/shared/sourceeditor/moz.build", "devtools/client/shared/vendor/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "devtools/client/shared/vendor/moz.build", "devtools/client/shared/widgets/moz.build", "devtools/shared/jsbeautify/moz.build", "devtools/shared/moz.build", "devtools/shared/network-observer/moz.build", "devtools/shared/storage/vendor/stringvalidator/LICENSE-NOTICE.txt", "devtools/shared/storage/vendor/stringvalidator/moz.build", "docs/code-quality/lint/linters/license.md", "dom/media/systemservices/moz.build", "dom/media/webaudio/bl