ch scoped registry keyed by\nnode. Elements traverse that edge and drop their entry on unlink, but shadow\nroots only dropped it in their destructor and documents never did, so the\nregistry (and everything its constructors reach, typically the window) was\ntreated as externally rooted: a definition closing over its shadow host leaked\nthe host, and initialize(document) leaked the registry until shutdown.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328106\n", "files": ["dom/base/CustomElementRegistry.cpp", "dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/base/Element.cpp", "dom/base/Element.h", "dom/base/FragmentOrElement.cpp", "dom/base/ShadowRoot.cpp", "dom/base/nsINode.cpp", "dom/tests/mochitest/webcomponents/mochitest.toml", "dom/tests/mochitest/webcomponents/test_custom_element_scoped_registry_gc.html", "testing/web-platform/meta/custom-elements/__dir__.ini"], "git_node": "82dddc0f382b02c996bd54e252fd281a3e3c51e8", "git_parents": ["2db31763c6d102f5cdd519b50763831aaa3fc4eb"], "node": "9ab87854d0331e21abee80a88d8842ebbe23f62d", "parents": ["433f218886f1c52a996ab16ee252bbd4764a4042"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dale Harvey \u003cdale@arandomurl.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074383 - Use moz-src for browser/components/prompts r=Gijs\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328078\n", "files": ["browser/components/prompts/components.conf", "browser/components/prompts/moz.build"], "git_node": "02d8a80d105ec621a7baf022372cd5d0879eac98", "git_parents": ["82dddc0f382b02c996bd54e252fd281a3e3c51e8"], "node": "c455fc83ddf59a6836ced27ebb1b353a5a595bf8", "parents": ["9ab87854d0331e21abee80a88d8842ebbe23f62d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dharma Ong \u003cdharmaong00@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066885 - Move searchbar-specific behavior from UrlbarInputBase into SearchbarInput. r=mak,urlbar-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321695\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/content/SearchbarInput.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarInputBase.mjs"], "git_node": "5d3e68c56fe09ef7ca87d67a03cd2aa807a0fc34", "git_parents": ["02d8a80d105ec621a7baf022372cd5d0879eac98"], "node": "cf90e2946731b8b42c8832f27a9bab0654d5a6fc", "parents": ["c455fc83ddf59a6836ced27ebb1b353a5a595bf8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rebecca King \u003crking@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057313 - Remove notification dot on VPN toolbar icon - r=ip-protection-reviewers,sstreich\n\nRemove trigger for notification dot without removing capability to show the badge for future major releases.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327900\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/ipprotection/IPProtectionPanel.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/IPProtectionToolbarButton.sys.mjs", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/browser/browser_ipprotection_toolbar.js", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/browser/head.js", "browser/components/ipprotection/tests/xpcshell/test_IPProtectionPanel.js", "toolkit/components/ipprotection/docs/Preferences.md"], "git_node": "311f7221347e18d86ae38820f25ac27a2cbd08bc", "git_parents": ["5d3e68c56fe09ef7ca87d67a03cd2aa807a0fc34"], "node": "2138832f2b84ed05dd120e5698c5105d2438e4de", "parents": ["cf90e2946731b8b42c8832f27a9bab0654d5a6fc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julian Descottes \u003cjdescottes@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067104 - [bidi] Update UserContextManager.createContext to support additional options r=Sasha\n\ncreateContext used to always generate a unique container name dynamically.\nWith this changeset you can optionally request to use a specific name,\ncolor and icon.\n\nNote that nothing prevents to create two containers with the same name,\ntherefore callers should be careful to check if the name is already in\nuse if they don't want to create containers with duplicated names.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://p