 "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2070404, Bug 2066315, Bug 2065228 - add telemetry about restoring into mismatched windows r=sfoster\" for causing debug marionette failures at sessionstore\n\nThis reverts commit a80e754e53b30836212c0695060e352541c1df8d.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2066315 - store and restore window arguments r=pdahiya,sfoster\"\n\nThis reverts commit 32f6b0db1b6831fcd9de985fd506dac113b1d2a1.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2065228 - remove `hidden` features from session state r=sfoster\"\n\nThis reverts commit c89a5e061f6ea7bdb593cec1e373e8ab9ba7c6b0.\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AIWindow.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sessionstore/SessionStore.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sessionstore/metrics.yaml", "browser/components/sessionstore/session.schema.json", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser.toml", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_354894_perwindowpb.js", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_495495.js", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_597071.js", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_oldformat.toml", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_restored_window_features.js", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_window_features_mismatch_telemetry.js", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/manifest.toml", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/session_store_test_case.py", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/test_automatic_startup_window_features_mismatch.py", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/test_automatic_with_taskbar_tab_window_features_mismatch.py", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/test_close_last_nonpopup_window.py", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/test_deferred_initial_state_window_features_mismatch.py", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/test_new_tab_on_restore.py", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/test_restore_last_session_window_mismatch.py", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/test_set_browser_state_window_features_mismatch.py"], "git_node": "b60f46722863c1a65b365ff700af5bdeb5747c87", "git_parents": ["60d6f25e0882df909dfae5cf689853dd070380bb"], "node": "06fb4888f5b1d99ea564fb0caeb4aeaa809f4ec4", "parents": ["ca55294f2b007fabef62f8bdfbbeee0e28df8e09"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2050211: apply code formatting via Lando\" for causing multiple reftests failures\n\nThis reverts commit 18be802fc4cf3cc32f5e78e09c93baf71a724c74.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2050211 - Honour shape-rendering: crispEdges for WebRender SVG rects. r=firefox-svg-reviewers,longsonr\"\n\nThis reverts commit 8947db015ab946ec825e7484031a52ba8d1d8052.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2050211 - Quantize reference frame origins in device space, not local space. r=gw\"\n\nThis reverts commit 877720c5c24a1defdd2c02e9146727b97e980781.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2050211 - Add a wrench test. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\"\n\nThis reverts commit e19a8107bca95be9abbc56f18a400e10c684fdda.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2050211 - Dont't snap anti-aliased primitives. r=gw\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6b3e7f49dd35932f228f4707e32590a82952fc4e.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2050211 - Wire up AA for primitives that have the ANTIALIASING flag. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\"\n\nThis reverts commit ff02306a5c15d8fdaef0d8b59c690b5d30fbd034.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2050211 - Make test 1780191-1.svg not rely on WebRender's incorrect snapping of SVG rectangles. r-#gfx-reviewers r=layout-reviewers,tnikkel\"\n\nThis reverts commit 65bf38606968dbf9c1ab4e4f3dfc5ab01e83d248.\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/clip.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/space.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/spatial_node.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/antialiased-ref.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/antialiased.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reference-frame-origin-scaled-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reference-frame-origin-scaled.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/yaml_frame_reader.rs", "layout/reftests/bugs/1780191-1-ref.svg", "layout/reftests/bugs/1780191-1.svg", "layout/reftests/bugs/reftest.list", "layout/svg/SVGGeometryFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/floats-clear/float-replaced-height-006.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/floats-clear/float-replaced-width-007.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/floats-clear/float-replaced-width-008.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/floats-clear/float-replaced-width-009.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/block-replaced-height-006.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/block-replaced-width-002.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-height-006.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-height-009.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-width-002.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-width-003.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-width-007.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-block-replaced-width-008.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-height-006.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-height-009.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-width-002.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-width-003.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-width-008.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/CSS2/normal-flow/inline-replaced-width-009.xht.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/compositing/mix-blend-mode/mix-blend-mode-svg.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-flexbox/svg-no-natural-size-grandchild.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/