eb3c383a07f0.\n\nThis reverts commit 58a06b68f333cc8b2407d21af52202f4a9abcfa0.\n", "files": ["dom/fetch/FetchDriver.h", "dom/filesystem/Directory.h", "dom/filesystem/GetFilesHelper.cpp", "dom/filesystem/GetFilesHelper.h", "dom/gamepad/GamepadMonitoring.h", "dom/gamepad/GamepadTouchState.h", "dom/workers/Queue.h", "dom/workers/WorkerDocumentListener.h", "dom/workers/WorkerIPCUtils.h", "dom/workers/loader/ScriptResponseHeaderProcessor.h"], "git_node": "d97494a4c80bab4534b33277fb685141f604b83d", "git_parents": ["c1454838b7e46d17047a541926a627693c58844e"], "node": "f5b14e8bb3b5ee82aa0d2f10def9e04629e19229", "parents": ["9ef5187a674911943dbe9d3c3784a785eecca0da"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073144 - Lint all dom/webtransport headers through clang-tidy r=necko-reviewers,kershaw\n\nIn that context, it just means making every header self-contained by\nbreaking some circular dependencies.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327955\n", "files": ["dom/webtransport/api/WebTransportReceiveStream.cpp", "dom/webtransport/api/WebTransportReceiveStream.h", "dom/webtransport/api/WebTransportSendStream.cpp", "dom/webtransport/api/WebTransportSendStream.h"], "git_node": "bba57950c3ced416683e39a84fd4f3595bccd527", "git_parents": ["d97494a4c80bab4534b33277fb685141f604b83d"], "node": "0075495ec8115969b165ca01c8f81c531ba912d4", "parents": ["f5b14e8bb3b5ee82aa0d2f10def9e04629e19229"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073144 - Lint all dom/vr headers through clang-tidy r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\n\nActually just making the header self-contained.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327956\n", "files": ["dom/vr/XRSystem.h"], "git_node": "fb755367e0fb98d1e19c36606d4f4396b59d7599", "git_parents": ["bba57950c3ced416683e39a84fd4f3595bccd527"], "node": "eefe69283cc1e8d17b985c62b490d395abe5a6e2", "parents": ["0075495ec8115969b165ca01c8f81c531ba912d4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073144 - Lint all dom/script headers through clang-tidy r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\n\nChanges includes:\n- using C++20 type aliases and inline variables\n- making deleted methods public\n- rework some include dependencies to make header self contained\n\nAll changes were detected either by header compilation failure, or by\nclang-tidy.\n\nFixes are either generated by clang-tidy or hand-made\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327957\n", "files": ["dom/script/ScriptDecoding.h", "dom/script/ScriptSettings.h", "dom/script/nsIScriptElement.h"], "git_node": "9eea1dbf6810f2212dc63ae05d921f8dbf3b93cc", "git_parents": ["fb755367e0fb98d1e19c36606d4f4396b59d7599"], "node": "190fa391f4ee4bfb255d2a4ea56f2c2dc3979522", "parents": ["eefe69283cc1e8d17b985c62b490d395abe5a6e2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Beatriz Rizental \u003cbea@torproject.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057375 - Rename ClientUUID to ClientUuid to satisfy the ClassAcronymCasing lint. r=android-reviewers,nalexander\n\nAlso renames PrefsBackedClientUUID and FakeClientUUID for consistency, and\ndrops the now-unneeded detekt-baseline.xml entries.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319581\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/ClientUUID.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/ClientUuid.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Components.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/debugsettings/integrity/FakeClientUUID.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/debugsettings/integrity/FakeClientUuid.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/debugsettings/integrity/IntegrityTools.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/debugsettings/navigation/DebugDrawerRoute.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/debugsettings/ui/FenixOverlay.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/ClientUUIDTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/ClientUuidTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/config/detekt-baseline.xml"], "git_node": "7271bd33ba6d703fc7aed77f98f070a2c9b52be4", "git_parents": ["9eea1dbf6810f2212dc63ae05d921f8dbf3b93cc"], "node": "3a780b4e764fa06955be10b9bdc5baa91a5fe69a", "parents": ["190fa391f4ee4bfb255d2a4ea56f2c2dc3979522"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Beatriz Rizental \u003cbea@torproject.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057375 - Confine GooglePlayIntegrityClient to Components.kt. r=nalexander,android-reviewers,matt-tighe\n\nDepends on D319581\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313912\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/concept/integrity/src/main/java/mozilla/components/concept/integrity/IntegrityClient.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/concept/integrity/src/main/java/mozilla/components/concept/integrity/RequestHashProvider.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/lib/integrity-googleplay/src/main/java/mozilla/components/lib/integrity/googleplay/GooglePlayIntegrityClient.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/lib/integrity-googleplay/src/main/java/mozilla/components/lib/integrity/googleplay/ext/StandardIntegrityManager.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/lib/integrity-googleplay/src/test/java/mozilla/components/lib/integrity/googleplay/GooglePlayIntegrityClientTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/ClientUuid.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/Components.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/llm/Llm.kt"], "gi