ow/scroll-axis-lock-none-touch.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-overflow/scroll-axis-lock-none-wheel.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-overflow/support/scroll-axis-lock.js"], "git_node": "bddad73f16aa884279b8fefdf1ee8593aa8a8638", "git_parents": ["abe10242df641c5f39c2bbc4df07ca9b5be9409d"], "node": "1b8d76f300bc1e558882290a52779511d66ebf98", "parents": ["dc6c10f7988dac5603903532a3fe8577a8563e1b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073395 [wpt PR 62770] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62770\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-overflow/scroll-axis-lock-dynamic-change.html.ini"], "git_node": "3b9272f02c47989b906fbc7c6fe769c4188d88d5", "git_parents": ["bddad73f16aa884279b8fefdf1ee8593aa8a8638"], "node": "c12270439e45511d4699bfb4876a72c7dcf3d752", "parents": ["1b8d76f300bc1e558882290a52779511d66ebf98"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fran\u00e7ois Beaufort \u003cbeaufort.francois@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073328 [wpt PR 62707] - [WebMCP] Move ModelContext unit tests to Web Platform Tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[WebMCP] Move ModelContext unit tests to Web Platform Tests\n\nThis CL moves tool tests from model_context_test.cc to WPT where\npossible, removes duplicate tests already covered in WPT, and cleans up\nunused test fixtures.\n\nTests moved to WPT:\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_Navigation -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-navigation.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_ValidationFailure -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-invalid-input.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_SPA,\n  ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_SPA_NoPreventDefault,\n  ManualSubmit_RespondWithThrows,\n  ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_LateRespondWithThrows,\n  ExecuteTool_RespondWith_And_Navigate -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-respondWith.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_SPA_NoAutoSubmit -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-no-autosubmit.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_FlexibleTypes -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-flexible-types.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_PseudoClasses,\n  ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_FormPopulatedAtEvent -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-pseudo-classes.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_NoToolChangeOnUnrelatedAttribute,\n  ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_NoToolChangeOnRedundantSchemaAttribute -\u003e\n  declarative/toolchange-on-attribute-mutation.https.html\n- ToolEventsDispatched -\u003e\n  imperative/executeTool-events.https.html\n\nTests copied to WPT (unit tests retained to verify internal ScriptToolErrorCode):\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_InvalidInput,\n  ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_InvalidSelectValue,\n  ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_ValidationFailureDetails -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-invalid-input.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_SPA_NoRespondWith -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-respondWith.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_SPA_Reject -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-respondWith-reject.https.html\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_Reset_Cancels,\n  ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_UnrelatedSubmitAndRemove -\u003e\n  declarative/executeTool-no-autosubmit.https.html\n\nDuplicate tests removed (already covered in WPT):\n- ExecuteTool (covered in imperative/object-arguments.https.html)\n- GetTools_InsecureOrigin (covered in imperative/getTools-filtering.https.html)\n- ExecuteToolReturnsObject (covered in imperative/executeTool-unregister-resolution-race.https.html)\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_ToolChangeOnNameChange (covered in declarative/toolchange-on-name-change.https.html)\n- ExecuteDeclarativeFormTool_ToolChangeOnControlAddRemove (covered in declarative/toolchange-on-control-add-remove.https.html)\n- ExecuteTool_RespondWith_And_RemoveForm (covered in declarative/form_removal_submit_crash.https.html)\n\nBug: none\nChange-Id: I5665d8f88ccf9f0af2a5d966d850488f5e7bd6df\nReviewed-on: https://chromiu