from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=324242 (#62815)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: fa5fc7eef59c968d09a03b7104a89028a836c157\nwpt-pr: 62815\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/svg/text/scripted/lengthadjust-char-positions.html"], "git_node": "9a76768e15b9a1e3e3924eb321cdf62c98f421e5", "git_parents": ["8cf1334875c48306082fcd1596bc40650f7d6579"], "node": "8b8957cd0f21bdadb8cd8e9ed9d52f38ec1a8114", "parents": ["bfaeb53d7eca17a980c5fc60e8a5fe889a20946c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073790 [wpt PR 62815] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62815\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/svg/text/scripted/lengthadjust-char-positions.html.ini"], "git_node": "327ec36983f54fbb7267793e7668ec2c91ab5e27", "git_parents": ["9a76768e15b9a1e3e3924eb321cdf62c98f421e5"], "node": "f061e9392e6c1f760c08c1d8248dc96d1fa7205d", "parents": ["8b8957cd0f21bdadb8cd8e9ed9d52f38ec1a8114"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Karl Dubost \u003ckarlcow@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073793 [wpt PR 62816] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=324552, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=324552 (#62816)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 986e75d7897742148c16253c08c50c8ba0e7b0f7\nwpt-pr: 62816\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-flexbox/svg-root-as-flex-item-007.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/svg-intrinsic-size-011.html"], "git_node": "19902603161712482071a102285b5057b6022c0f", "git_parents": ["327ec36983f54fbb7267793e7668ec2c91ab5e27"], "node": "441bfc8182cb36d579d5f4d7b616a7b1dec4c4cd", "parents": ["f061e9392e6c1f760c08c1d8248dc96d1fa7205d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ahmad Saleem \u003c52317531+Ahmad-S792@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073832 [wpt PR 62817] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=322922, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=322922 (#62817)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: bc93a431ddd2e301dece2c6346eb23858aa487a8\nwpt-pr: 62817\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/svg/animations/smil-detach-releases-animated-presentation-attribute.html"], "git_node": "257e7d5e0d8f2753eb508b9609c964908adac210", "git_parents": ["19902603161712482071a102285b5057b6022c0f"], "node": "362e41422ca52dc1b0fc0fae62484317128254ac", "parents": ["441bfc8182cb36d579d5f4d7b616a7b1dec4c4cd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matt Hargett \u003cplaztiksyke@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072983 [wpt PR 62756] - webnn: cover triangular masking edge cases, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nwebnn: cover triangular masking edge cases (#62756)\n\n* webnn: cover triangular negative diagonals and non-finite masking\n\n* webnn: test exact int32 triangular boundary values\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 269bca0dd35c303639f3c9cf1d8bcb3d911bdb60\nwpt-pr: 62756\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webnn/conformance_tests/triangular.https.any.js"], "git_node": "9b1c6434d48b4e4050c42e593d9b6d4a1639486c", "git_parents": ["257e7d5e0d8f2753eb508b9609c964908adac210"], "node": "8e65aeca843645caeece066ab701126c9be896db", "parents": ["362e41422ca52dc1b0fc0fae62484317128254ac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Etienne No\u00ebl \u003cetiennenoel@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073867 [wpt PR 62820] - Fix Built-In AI WebDX feature names and add WPT WEB_FEATURES.yml files, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nFix Built-In AI WebDX feature names and add WPT WEB_FEATURES.yml files\n\n1. The WebDXFeature enum name and histogram label map to W3C\nweb-features IDs by splitting CamelCase on capital letters with hyphens.\nBecause buckets 420 and 425 were named kLanguageModel /\nlabel=\"LanguageModel\" and kLanguageDetector / label=\"LanguageDetector\",\nthe pipeline exported them as \"language-model\" and \"language-detector\"\ninstead of the actual web-features IDs \"languagemodel\" and\n\"languagedetector\". Rename them to kLanguagemodel and kLanguagedetector\nand update enums.xml accordingly.\n\nNote: While an alternative would be keeping kLanguageModel /\nkLanguageDetector in Chromium and renaming the upstream YAML files in\nweb-platform-dx/web-features to use dashes (language-model.yml and\nlanguage-detector.yml with redirects), doing so requires too many\nexternal steps (upstream W3C repo PR review, a new web-features npm\nrelease, and downstream dependency bumps in webstatus.dev and wpt.fyi).\nAligning Chromium's enum names directly with the published web-features\nidentifiers fixes the dashboards immediately in a single step.\n\n2. Add missing WEB_FEATURES.yml files for all Built-In AI APIs present\nin web-platform-dx/web-features:\n- third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/ai/language-model/WEB_FEATURES.yml ([languagemodel])\n- third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/ai/language_detection/WEB_FEATURES.yml ([languagedetector])\n- third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/ai/translator/WEB_FEATURES.yml ([translator])\n\nTAG=agy\nCONV=22933575-5b82-4d34-8f1c-7aac2d71a7ff\n\nBug: 563353292\nChange-Id: I9bb991048f45681e48ed8426f2e0536139736100\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8431371\nCommit-Queue: Etienne No\u00ebl \u003cetiennenoel@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Reilly Grant \u003creillyg@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Kentaro Hara \u003charaken@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1701486}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 26f417a8c09fbfcc0b4fcf55760f31090ef2b772\nwpt-pr: 62820\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/ai/language-model/WEB_FEATURES.yml", "testing/web-platform/tests/ai/language_detection/WEB_FEATURES.yml", "testing/web-platform/tests/ai/translator/WEB_FEATURES.yml"], "git_node": "69610becb0709bfda4392fb4ec8e8a44b7fa0386", "git_parents": ["9b1c6434d48b4e4050c42e593d9b6d4a1639486c"], "node": "9acb1325cfb0325a0e9c8161f09b91cbe729abe2", "parents": ["8e65aeca843645caeece066ab701126c9be896db"], "tags": []}, {"author": "tannal \u003cmtan@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071576 [wpt PR 62648] - Sanitizer: Add javascript: URL tests for all MathML elements, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nSanitizer: Add javascript: URL tests for all MathML elements\n\nA minimal test for https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12592\n\nThe end to end tests that verify the navigation can not happen will come with https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8212842\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 5eb2f0edd14017bec0338464b3bcfe4cf1c530bd\nwpt-pr: 62648\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/sanitizer-api/sanitizer-javascript-url.html"], "git_node": "1181f57e1631ac3205235fbdeae397df3b5af47f", "git_parents": ["69610becb0709bfda4392fb4ec8e8a44b7fa0386"], "node": "c0dfaa3f728e11dde8fa656f163516d7cd7296cb", "parents": ["9acb1325cfb0325a0e9c8161f09b91cbe729abe2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071576 [wpt PR 62648] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62648\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/sanitizer-api/sanitizer-javascript-url.html.ini"], "git_node": "2e55b85b8ab5e64c9794fae8fd8885f92dfd2870", "git_parents": ["1181f57e1631ac3205235fbdeae397df3b5af47f"], "node": "0ea41b072c94fd83e6afdcf24f0addceae4323d3", "parents": ["c0dfaa3f728e11dde8fa656f163516d7cd7296cb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "wpt-pr-bot \u003cwpt-pr-bot@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073908 [wpt PR 62821] - Update Test262 tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nUpdate Test262 tests\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 730ca21861cfab9c9a2a5f508a13ec9b88673782\nwpt-pr: 62821\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/harness/testIntl.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Collator/ignore-invalid-unicode-ext-values.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Collator/numeric-and-caseFirst.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/DateTimeFormat/casing-numbering-system-calendar-options.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/DateTimeFormat/numbering-system-calendar-options.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/DateTimeFormat/prototype/resolvedOptions/resolved-locale-with-hc-unicode.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/constructor-options-firstDayOfWeek-invalid.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/constructor-options-firstDayOfWeek-valid.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/constructor-unicode-extension-uvalue-true.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/constructor-unicode-extension-uvalue-yes.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/prototype/calendar/canonicalize-case.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/prototype/collation/canonicalize-case.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/prototype/firstDayOfWeek/valid-id.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/prototype/firstDayOfWeek/valid-options.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/Locale/prototype/numberingSystem/canonicalize-case.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/NumberFormat/casing-numbering-system-options.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/NumberFormat/numbering-system-options.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/NumberFormat/test-option-currency.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/NumberFormat/throws-for-currency-style-without-currency-option.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/test/intl402/default-locale-is-canonicalized.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/third_party/test262/vendored.toml"], "git_node": "40bce00dc86a6ddacdebf2afa07dfdfca863de91", "git_parents": ["2e55b85b8ab5e64c9794fae8fd8885f92dfd2870"], "node": "e6990862887af104421b9994e6f99f0e479c5520", "parents": ["0ea41b072c94fd83e6afdcf24f0addceae4323d3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Domenic Denicola \u003cd@domenic.me\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073999 [wpt PR 62822] - Test inert in the generic HTML reflection suite, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nTest inert in the generic HTML reflection suite\n\nCo-Authored-By: codex \u003ccodex@openai.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 6b96a85f61b069b57e26b27cc9160c19ea57f74f\nwpt-pr: 62822\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/reflection.js"], "git_node": "849a3a28aa8a88f465371d180bcf735200eb1b4e", "git_parents": ["40bce00dc86a6ddacdebf2afa07dfdfca863de91"], "node": "975ae9a5f8deb218381d4e850d7b49317dda6633", "parents": ["e6990862887af104421b9994e6f99f0e479c5520"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Domenic Denicola \u003cd@domenic.me\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071468 [wpt PR 62622] - Test frame post-connection behavior, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nTest frame post-connection behavior\n\nCheck child-window creation order when frames and iframes are inserted atomically with scripts, including indexed access to their windows. Cover connection inside shadow trees and documents without browsing contexts.\n\nCo-authored-by: codex \u003ccodex@openai.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: a83afd4402cffdc876508fe9a47f916d4136099f\nwpt-pr: 62622\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/dom/nodes/insertion-removing-steps/frame-post-connection-steps.html"], "git_node": "c14996640aa0ab350ef246566ea7a019aa0d25ee", "git_parents": ["849a3a28aa8a88f465371d180bcf735200eb1b4e"], "node": "5ec2fe8192ffdea965883ec6e121decdcccd1552", "parents": ["975ae9a5f8deb218381d4e850d7b49317dda6633"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071468 [wpt PR 62622] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62622\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/dom/nodes/insertion-removing-steps/frame-post-connection-steps.html.ini"], "git_node": "507d5b649a9a20e79a9266dd04b7eafef5579e65", "git_parents": ["c14996640aa0ab350ef246566ea7a019aa0d25ee"], "node": "34ed42b435d375f7cd3958d8ba28d265120bdf6e", "parents": ["5ec2fe8192ffdea965883ec6e121decdcccd1552"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Himesha Baddage \u003chimesha.baddage@codimite.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074058 [wpt PR 62826] - css: Invalidate gradients using viewport units on viewport resize, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\ncss: Invalidate gradients using viewport units on viewport resize\n\nGradient color stops and positions are resolved when the gradient is\npainted rather than during style resolution, and CSSGradientValue::\nGetImage discards the length conversion flags produced by that\nresolution. An element whose gradient used a viewport-relative length\ntherefore recorded no viewport dependency on its computed style, so\nresizing the viewport never marked it for style recalc. Even a forced\nrecalc produced an equal StyleGeneratedImage, so the computed style\nwas reused and the previously rasterized gradient stayed on screen\nuntil the page was reloaded.\n\nRecord the viewport unit dependency when the generated image is\ncreated, and snapshot the viewport size on StyleGeneratedImage so that\nthe image compares unequal once the viewport changes. The resulting\nstyle difference drives both the paint invalidation and the eviction\nof the cached gradient bitmap.\n\nThis mirrors the existing handling of container-relative units, and\nkeeps the generated image cache effective for gradients that do not\ndepend on the viewport. Radial and conic gradient positions and sizes\nare covered as well, since they resolve viewport units too.\n\nBug: 557316486\nChange-Id: I8bdbc56c9f5a340a370192b979362a7df5031cf4\nFixed: 557316486\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8383617\nReviewed-by: Rune Lillesveen \u003cfuthark@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Kevin Babbitt \u003ckbabbitt@microsoft.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Rune Lillesveen \u003cfuthark@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1701665}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 2c0aa054d29db543f6c6bb76352b4a66da58e846\nwpt-pr: 62826\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-images/linear-gradient-viewport-units-invalidation-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-images/linear-gradient-viewport-units-invalidation.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-images/support/linear-gradient-viewport-units-iframe.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-images/support/linear-gradient-viewport-units-ref-iframe.html"], "git_node": "24a21c1bb363ce73ec5bc219a01697b73bf30351", "git_parents": ["507d5b649a9a20e79a9266dd04b7eafef5579e65"], "node": "3a12c76f4d47146b3d2cc96377c7582819e25c5f", "parents": ["34ed42b435d375f7cd3958d8ba28d265120bdf6e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Brent Fulgham \u003c44174109+brentfulgham@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073755 [wpt PR 62807] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=324192, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=324192 (#62807)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 16e53be6d1be37263e6b98a3232f587eee8672fa\nwpt-pr: 62807\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/rendering/replaced-elements/attributes-for-embedded-content-and-images/img-empty-alt-replaced-block.html"], "git_node": "8497ac32a3c083693a464ed1866d08549cf1191c", "git_parents": ["24a21c1bb363ce73ec5bc219a01697b73bf30351"], "node": "dc713aec45d6955a0457f38e3871879447c5adad", "parents": ["3a12c76f4d47146b3d2cc96377c7582819e25c5f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dominik R\u00f6ttsches \u003cdrott@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074174 [wpt PR 62836] - Add WPT test for redundant xmlns attribute retention, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd WPT test for redundant xmlns attribute retention\n\nVerify that the XML parser retains redundant xmlns and xmlns:prefix\nattributes when the same namespace is already in scope, either\ndirectly on the parent or across an intermediate un-namespaced element.\n\nAdd expected failure baselines for the XMLRustForNonXslt parser where\nthese attributes are currently dropped.\n\nBug: 562298032, 559815538\nChange-Id: I2c9a33aa8cf7be7b7f76c9c75c33bb30283ec871\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8432825\nReviewed-by: David Baron \u003cdbaron@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Dominik R\u00f6ttsches \u003cdrott@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Dominik R\u00f6ttsches \u003cdrott@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1701773}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 16ddb735c5027ffc79f410c9a83f5766b810ca58\nwpt-pr: 62836\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/xml/retain_redundant_xmlns.html"], "git_node": "9ed59405d78ba3f1c22eda24d5eeb42b1ae30c57", "git_parents": ["8497ac32a3c083693a464ed1866d08549cf1191c"], "node": "e71de81ea575292312b98171bcab72ae0f218026", "parents": ["dc713aec45d6955a0457f38e3871879447c5adad"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Brent Fulgham \u003c44174109+brentfulgham@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073759 [wpt PR 62808] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=201725, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=201725 (#62808)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: e6a00e812093abfcf17eccf99268d456f15948ea\nwpt-pr: 62808\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-fonts/synthetic-bold-does-not-widen-advances.html", "testing/web-plat