 by clang-tidy or hand-made\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327952\n", "files": ["dom/fetch/FetchDriver.h", "dom/filesystem/Directory.h", "dom/filesystem/GetFilesHelper.cpp", "dom/filesystem/GetFilesHelper.h"], "git_node": "34d09d51668421ab2f06cf701427e024281f1334", "git_parents": ["bf3c6708fb2cb62d9bb636314cf1903d73b5f2ef"], "node": "48dcf89e1cb764394a890d2123fcc3f5fb5749c4", "parents": ["e77d8dbd86b229496e429610c019e7cdde63348d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073144 - Lint all dom/gamepad headers through clang-tidy r=device-api-reviewers,gstoll\n\nWhich actually mean adding missing headers dependencies to make every\nheader self-contained.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327953\n", "files": ["dom/gamepad/GamepadMonitoring.h", "dom/gamepad/GamepadTouchState.h"], "git_node": "00e6f1a92c5f99e32ce3391b0b78b957f4798336", "git_parents": ["34d09d51668421ab2f06cf701427e024281f1334"], "node": "daf78417779093c6f95dd35825edd93bc0541f92", "parents": ["48dcf89e1cb764394a890d2123fcc3f5fb5749c4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073144 - Lint all dom/workers headers through clang-tidy r=dom-worker-reviewers,edenchuang\n\nChanges includes:\n- making deleted methods public\n- rework some include dependencies to make header self contained\n\nAll changes were detected either by header compilation failure, or by\nclang-tidy.\n\nFixes are either generated by clang-tidy or hand-made\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327954\n", "files": ["dom/workers/Queue.h", "dom/workers/WorkerDocumentListener.h", "dom/workers/WorkerIPCUtils.h", "dom/workers/loader/ScriptResponseHeaderProcessor.h"], "git_node": "e647cc89cafe2ab752117f9ca165bd00a6e1aeac", "git_parents": ["00e6f1a92c5f99e32ce3391b0b78b957f4798336"], "node": "7539ea39d041