m/promise headers through clang-tidy r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\n\nChanges includes:\n- using C++20 inline expression\n\nAll changes were detected and fixed by clang-tidy.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327961\n", "files": ["dom/promise/Promise-inl.h"], "git_node": "f6b5013a2c47fdec819c7749782e789b1c319277", "git_parents": ["08a61e1a51dbb4dbff0bb8e9ef97ad19c3afb156"], "node": "2d6b67a550899aff1b6969787861a1eb66a66295", "parents": ["b7b0ca48b93608c43e267b7c4568cb0816c536dd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073144 - Lint all dom/quota headers through clang-tidy r=dom-storage-reviewers,jari\n\nChanges includes:\n- using C++20 type aliases and inline variable\n- making deleted methods public\n- making some methods default\n- rework some include dependencies to make header self contained\n\nAll changes were detected either by header compilation failure, or by\nclang-tidy.\n\nFixes are either generated by clang-tidy or hand-made\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327962\n", "files": ["dom/quota/CheckedUnsafePtr.h", "dom/quota/ClientImpl.h", "dom/quota/ClientStorageScope.h", "dom/quota/DirectoryLock.h", "dom/quota/DummyCipherStrategy.h", "dom/quota/OriginScope.h", "dom/quota/QuotaCommon.h", "dom/quota/SerializationHelpers.h"], "git_node": "52bef91d3d62e59578511cd5beb1070c449099f8", "git_parents": ["f6b5013a2c47fdec819c7749782e789b1c319277"], "node": "12fa12c4def1882ca6e45e502673f811a6f2cd0d", "parents": ["2d6b67a550899aff1b6969787861a1eb66a66295"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073144 - Lint all dom/reporting headers through clang-tidy r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\n\nAdd missing includes to make every header self-contained and thus\nanalyzable by clang-tidy.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327963\n", "files":