ver/spawn r=taskgraph-reviewers,bhearsum\n\nForce the worker processes to import gecko_taskgraph so they use the\ncorrect graph config schema.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328506\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/main.py"], "git_node": "4d860882dc8a076f3f386e7303f35caf617299e5", "git_parents": ["df8487d6e12e7416105942362cf75355be52d3ad"], "node": "53e95e8ab8f67599082e022ba245886d40de7ee0", "parents": ["fb806040e208464e1570624823eefc84b09144e1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matthew Gaudet \u003cmgaudet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074626 - Close gap with move assignment r=smaug\n\nAs written the move assignment operator would allow you to overwrite an unconsumed task.\n\nThis asserts that the task is consumed before move in.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328282\n", "files": ["xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSContext.h"], "git_node": "6815e484b7e3e7a1d0229fe971cec8221bdef95e", "git_parents": ["4d860882dc8a076f3f386e7303f35caf617299e5"], "node": "ee4dc2b714d308113350c5eac8654b7343a2a4a5", "parents": ["53e95e8ab8f67599082e022ba245886d40de7ee0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matthew Gaudet \u003cmgaudet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074626 - Crash as desired on lost microtasks r=smaug\n\nIn a couple of places we were missing OOM checks, so we have added them back.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328283\n", "files": ["xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSContext.cpp", "xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSContext.h"], "git_node": "228c30cc668490d94c926231d23d8c6d7570964b", "git_parents": ["6815e484b7e3e7a1d0229fe971cec8221bdef95e"], "node": "3c1f49a1ad11b83b913582a4c64c51f029ca153f", "parents": ["ee4dc2b714d308113350c5eac8654b7343a2a4a5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matthew Gaudet \u003cmgaudet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074626 - Mark SaveMicroTaskQueue as nodiscard r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jonco\n\nTo ensure